


translate english d4_begin_fox_56afeb5b:


    "Byasha joined us at the table, gnawing anxiously on his lower lip."


translate english d4_begin_fox_89386159:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/158To.ogg"
    Bya "Toshik, you’re almost living in that fuckin’ forest..."


translate english d4_begin_fox_66a8d62c:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/158 V.ogg"
    Bya "Have you seen anything strange yesterday, eh?"


translate english d4_begin_fox_e88f2dea:


    "I replied with a complete lie."


translate english d4_begin_fox_108fdaec:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/4. N.ogg"
    Ant "Nuh-uh."


translate english d4_begin_fox_5b60843f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/69 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "Me neither."


translate english d4_begin_fox_99b61351:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/70 po.ogg"
    Rom "I got lucky that the homeroom teacher complained to my folks about my grades."


translate english d4_begin_fox_fed9ee63:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/71 Vot.ogg"
    Rom "So they didn’t let me out for our rehearsal."


translate english d4_begin_fox_5bee1f04:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/72 A.ogg"
    Rom "If they did, we’d be in Katya’s shoes now."


translate english d4_begin_fox_fe36355d:


    "Byasha scratched at his Adam’s apple."


translate english d4_begin_fox_1e2cf5ee:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/159 E.ogg"
    Bya "So... Here’s this thing, eh..."


translate english d4_begin_fox_7ed291bb:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/160 Ya.ogg"
    Bya "I heard something..."


translate english d4_begin_fox_f1a4703d:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/161 E.ogg"
    Bya "I was going to school this morning, as usual. And then I heard a shrill cry coming from behind the trees. A girl’s voice. See what I mean, eh?"


translate english d4_begin_fox_af1b4cac:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/162 Nu.ogg"
    Bya "I didn’t know about Katya then. Even if I did, it would’ve still been scary, guys…"


translate english d4_begin_fox_7b1cef41:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/163 Ut.ogg"
    Bya "Mornings here are as bad as nights. It’s so dark you can’t see a thing."


translate english d4_begin_fox_75c8247a:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/164 v.ogg"
    Bya "What if it was Katya?"


translate english d4_begin_fox_51142bc5:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/165A.ogg"
    Bya "And it was in the worst possible place, eh, among the windfall, near the cemetery."


translate english d4_begin_fox_65793266:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/73 Hor.ogg"
    Rom "Bullshit!"


translate english d4_begin_fox_22445305:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/166 Da.ogg"
    Bya "I swear, eh! Heard it with my own ears."


translate english d4_begin_fox_181669a9:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/5. A.ogg"
    Ant "Are you sure Katya really went missing?"


translate english d4_begin_fox_032bf4e4:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/74Vo.ogg"
    Rom "Look, even her mom, Lilia Pavlovna, didn’t show up for work today."


translate english d4_begin_fox_332bff32:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/167 S.ogg"
    Bya "The test is off, eh."


translate english d4_begin_fox_b2cec123:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/168 Ka.ogg"
    Bya "I’m telling you guys, it was Katya, moaning in the Taiga."


translate english d4_begin_fox_3ad865bf:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/169 A.ogg"
    Bya "The serial killer got her, too!"


translate english d4_begin_fox_b67c713f:


    "I remembered Katya. She was both beautiful and mean."


translate english d4_begin_fox_9c6ac6ac:


    "The first girl in our class with a maturing body, to the envy of all the other girls."


translate english d4_begin_fox_7d4cd672:


    "The main source of gossip, a snake, and a bitch."


translate english d4_begin_fox_618afe2c:


    "Byasha started counting with his fingers."


translate english d4_begin_fox_d9f6ea58:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/170 Se.ogg"
    Bya "Senechka, Vova, Semyon, Katya... Four people, eh!"


translate english d4_begin_fox_e2307988:


    "Roma slammed his hands on the desk."


translate english d4_begin_fox_4b6b9b2a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/75 Ta.ogg"
    Rom "Alright, guys. From now on, we always keep our guard up."


translate english d4_begin_fox_04442c78:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/76 Da.ogg"
    Rom "Don’t split off from the group like in those stupid horror movies."


translate english d4_begin_fox_fc7b27a2:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/77 Na.ogg"
    Rom "I don’t care about the rest, but you two are under my protection."


translate english d4_begin_fox_89c0bd08:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/78 Kak.ogg"
    Rom "And Polina, too..."


translate english d4_begin_fox_f8b3341d:


    "I hope your relationship works out."


translate english d4_begin_fox_f87ba3e1:


    "I had already forgotten that I was ever into Polina."


translate english d4_begin_fox_ad1e32ed:


    "The only girl occupying my thoughts after last night was Alisa."


translate english d4_begin_fox_f11ae9bd:


    "The boys went to the cafeteria, and I was left alone, scribbling in my notebook, drawing rows of pines and two small figures, flying between the treetops and the full moon."


translate english d4_begin_fox_f6fb7f8c:


    "Shivers ran up to my shoulders, sneaking playfully under the hem of my shirt."


translate english d4_begin_fox_9ae3dd81:


    "Even though soaring through the sky felt so simple... There was still something evil weighing me down."


translate english d4_begin_fox_98a408fd:


    "Was it the stolen signet ring, or the heavy look those missing kids from the notice board were giving me?"


translate english d4_begin_fox_92e56486:


    "The culprit was definitely still in the village; they were hiding something horrible under a mask of piousness."


translate english d4_begin_fox_0b267328:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/134 R.ogg"
    Pol "What are you drawing?"


translate english d4_begin_fox_e6134f99:


    "Embarrassed, I covered the notebook, as if there was something shameful about the figures above the forest."


translate english d4_begin_polina_1734efad:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I couldn't believe it at first, but Lilia Pavlovna didn't come to work today."


translate english d4_begin_polina_41d79bf7:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/Kon.ogg"
    Pol "The test is off."


translate english d4_begin_polina_b67c713f:


    "I remembered Katya. She was both beautiful and mean."


translate english d4_begin_polina_77575402:


    "Katya. The first girl in our class whose body started maturing, to the envy of all the other female students."


translate english d4_begin_polina_7d4cd672:


    "The main source of gossip, a snake, and a bitch."


translate english d4_begin_polina_f6fb7f8c:


    "Shivers ran up to my shoulders, sneaking playfully under the hem of my shirt."


translate english d4_begin_polina_9ae3dd81:


    "Even though soaring through the sky felt so simple... There was still something evil weighing me down."


translate english d4_begin_polina_98a408fd:


    "Was it the stolen signet ring, or the heavy look those missing kids from the notice board were giving me?"


translate english d4_begin_polina_92e56486:


    "The culprit was definitely still in the village; they were hiding something horrible under a mask of piousness."


translate english d4_begin_polina_c08d8baa:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/Achto.ogg"
    Pol "What are you drawing?"


translate english d4_begin_polina_e6134f99:


    "Embarrassed, I covered the notebook, as if there was something shameful about the figures above the forest."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_b8abc601:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/8. Da.ogg"
    Ant "Nothing really... Just fooling around."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_d06678e2:


    "Polina put her elbows on the desk."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_67f3ec94:


    "I had already forgotten how light and graceful she was, just like a violin."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_7573a2db:


    "The anger and rage that boiled inside me yesterday, during our phone call, subsided, hid in a hole. I just couldn't stay mad at Polina."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_5633ba56:


    "I wish she could also jump around with us, after stripping away her mask of fake mundanity."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_172f08c6:


    "I smiled, imagining Polina’s skirt flapping in the wind, the stars, sparkling all around us, her asking in bewilderment whether it is all a dream."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_1e553341:


    "And myself telling her that it doesn’t matter..."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_f701ab98:


    "Polina's expression grew dark again."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_66d0b8f8:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/134 Uze.ogg"
    Pol "Have you heard about Katya?"


translate english d4_polkatya_general_3075cc93:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/9. Uzas.ogg"
    Ant "It’s a tragedy."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_2c7f0383:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/135 Da.ogg"
    Pol "Yeah."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_af77b4e4:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/01 Uz.ogg"
    Pol "It’s also tragic that I find it difficult to empathize with her."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_e321a007:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/02 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I tried so hard, but then I remembered all her nasty deeds and..."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_53c1f636:


    "Polina shook her head."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_1ddd38e2:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/03YaCh.ogg"
    Pol "I’m a monster, aren’t I?"


translate english d4_polkatya_general_bef1a361:


    "\"No,\" I thought, \"you’re one of the most beautiful girls I’ve ever met.\""


translate english d4_polkatya_general_978c03be:


    "\"No,\" I thought, \"you’re one of the most beautiful girls I’ve ever met. But alas, you’re only number two on that list.\""


translate english d4_polkatya_general_ca23278e:


    "I decided not to say that out loud."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_50d10bd5:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/04 Plo.ogg"
    Pol "It’s not okay that I felt worse when I lost my questionnaire than when she went missing."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_ea8d365f:


    "My nostrils picked up the smell of candy, tree resin, and fireworks."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_e112d4cb:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/10. T.ogg"
    Ant "You lost your questionnaire?"


translate english d4_polkatya_general_1105aed3:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/05da Ektoto.ogg"
    Pol "Yes. Somebody out there is reading other people’s secrets now."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_8b1cd88e:


    "\"Yes, the forest,\" I thought, imagining the crooked branches turning notebook pages, touching the childish handwriting with their icy twigs."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_5e060315:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/06 Na.ogg"
    Pol "I hope the search goes well."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_ff825d4f:


    "I was unsure whether she spoke about Katya or her notebook."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_c861f3d5:


    "I wanted to ask her about it, but then I noticed Polina's intense stare directed at me."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_2882cda2:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/11. Cht.ogg"
    Ant "What?"


translate english d4_polkatya_general_35977029:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/07 Ti.ogg"
    Pol "You’ve changed."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_c8d3cc76:


    "I smoothed my hair flat, surprised."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_904a0f91:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/12. Pros.ogg"
    Ant "I just didn’t sleep well tonight."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_00c6c6b0:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/08 Se.ogg"
    Pol "You’re a different melody today. Some mysterious, ancient tune…"


translate english d4_polkatya_general_6bb1fed0:


    "I thought about the flute’s melody, streaming between the bushy treetops."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_ce497e09:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/09 Nad.ogg"
    Pol "I hope you haven’t told anyone about our chat yesterday?"


translate english d4_polkatya_general_e3f1692a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/13. Cto.ogg"
    Ant "Of course, not!"


translate english d4_polkatya_general_f796fec8:


    "She nodded as if acknowledging that she can fully trust me."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_7ea31629:


    "I was unsure whether I merited such trust."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_f029d401:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/15 A moz.ogg"
    Pol "Want to go for a walk after school?"


translate english d4_polkatya_general_ae27c1e8:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/16 Ded.ogg"
    Pol "Grandpa has been feeling better recently, I can return home a bit later."


translate english d4_polkatya_general_34766af2:


    "Her hair cascaded down around her shoulders. The smell was so wonderful that it sent me flying toward the glowing stars of my inner cosmos without any magic."


translate english d4_school_polina_437c4a4a:


    "At that moment, I felt Byasha's piercing stare. He was clearly watching us."


translate english d4_school_polina_05fee426:


    "I took my glasses off so I wouldn't be able to see his nasty smirk."


translate english d4_school_polina_3bb2ed56:


    "Yet a picture of Romka's knife gleamed before my mind's eye. My palms became sweaty."


translate english d4_school_polina_830e9a79:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/10 Op.ogg"
    Pol "Did you fall asleep again?"


translate english d4_school_polina_312e021f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/14. Po.ogg"
    Ant "Polina..."


translate english d4_school_polina_d00c2cc0:


    "{i}\"Tell her,\"{/i} a voice in my head whispered to me, {i}\"and to hell with the consequences\"{/i}."


translate english d4_school_polina_eb867b4f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/15. k.ogg"
    Ant "I think Romka has his eyes on you."


translate english d4_school_polina_a643e3f7:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/11 Du.ogg"
    Pol "You think I don't know?"


translate english d4_school_polina_7b499e9a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/16. Ot.ogg"
    Ant "But how?"


translate english d4_school_polina_e7d9f45b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/12 Sch.ogg"
    Pol "Let's say it's my intuition."


translate english d4_school_polina_8ffc70ae:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/13 Pya.ogg"
    Pol "But I don't care about Pyatifanov at all."


translate english d4_school_polina_f6c60b77:


    "That wonderful news made me more confident."


translate english d4_school_polina_95cbf125:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/17. Mn.ogg"
    Ant "I think he lacks the brains to win your attention."


translate english d4_school_polina_ff3d998a:


    "Polina flashed me an alluring smile."


translate english d4_school_polina_b83f8c68:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/14Ho.ogg"
    Pol "It's a good thing I have you, then."


translate english d4_school_polina_af0bea69:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/15 A.ogg"
    Pol "Want to go for a walk after school?"


translate english d4_school_polina_a74474dc:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/16 De.ogg"
    Pol "Grandpa has been feeling better recently, I can return home a bit later."


translate english d4_school_polina_44e3b345:


    "I signed my death sentence when I replied."


translate english d4_school_polina_f1afa199:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/20. Ko.ogg"
    Ant "Yeah, sure!"


translate english d4_school_polina_4f77a0ae:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/17 To.ogg"
    Pol "Then I'll see you later."


translate english d4_school_polina_4704f65d:


    "She leaned forward and looked at me with her piercing eyes, again."


translate english d4_school_polina_34598843:


    "Then mumbled, as if guessing."


translate english d4_school_polina_201fbf08:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/18 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "Something from Musorgsky?"


translate english d4_school_polina_104b473b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/19 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "No, probably not."


translate english d4_school_polina_02e5a0a9:


    "She left, and in her place, Romka's underling started drilling me with his eyes."


translate english d4_school_polina_e8887df7:


    "His thumb slid under his Adam's apple as if saying:\"You're dead.\""


translate english d4_school_polina_9895e676:


    "The bell rang."


translate english d4_school_polina_69468793:


    "The rest of the classes flew by and I was finally able to leave the school."


translate english d4_school_polina_ddf7ccdd:


    "Small whirlwinds rushed across the schoolyard like spinning tops."


translate english d4_school_polina_849bc9d9:


    "Big white flakes fell from the sky."


translate english d4_school_polina_5fb46a39:


    "Street lights gleamed in the semi-dark. Their shine crystallized in the cold, became firm and pointy."


translate english d4_school_polina_99f3ab4c:


    "A dog whined in the distance, making me think of poor Zhulka."


translate english d4_school_polina_1b57dfc8:


    "Polina stood at the school steps. The wind played with her hair."


translate english d4_school_polina_900a755c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/24. Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I’ve already forgotten the city's bustle. This place is so tranquil."


translate english d4_school_polina_6c01c890:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/20 O.ogg"
    Pol "Oh, and I dream of that cacophony!"


translate english d4_school_polina_ace25c96:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/25. O.ogg"
    Ant "Caco... what?"


translate english d4_school_polina_6ac016e6:


    "My companion burst out laughing."


translate english d4_school_polina_3fe53318:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/21 Kak.ogg"
    Pol "A cacophony is the chaotic mixture of sounds."


translate english d4_school_polina_2d10daea:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/22 De.ogg"
    Pol "Grandpa always taught me to look for a melody in everything."


translate english d4_school_polina_e166080a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/26. On.ogg"
    Ant "Your grandpa sounds cool."


translate english d4_school_polina_b6f755d5:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/23 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "He truly is! I’ll introduce you soon."


translate english d4_school_polina_2ad96f91:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/27. Ti.ogg"
    Ant "Are you inviting me to come over?"


translate english d4_school_polina_cfd3c3b7:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/24 A.ogg"
    Pol "You don’t want to?"


translate english d4_school_polina_fc948e45:


    "A nasty whistle swept across the yard, interrupting me."


translate english d4_school_polina_50fb5686:


    "Two silhouettes materialized from the snowfall: hands inside their pockets and heads kept low."


translate english d4_school_polina_467d5147:


    "The way that tough duo walked toward us didn't bode well for me."


translate english d4_school_polina_cf0d5948:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/214Anu.ogg"
    Rom "Get your hands off her! Now!"


translate english d4_school_polina_6b240421:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/215Polin.ogg"
    Rom "You alright, Polina? Did he harm you?"


translate english d4_school_polina_0d563bf3:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/01 M.ogg"
    Bya "We saw it, eh!"


translate english d4_school_polina_7da1d3f6:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/64. Vid.ogg"
    Ant "Saw what?"


translate english d4_school_polina_950f69c3:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/216Chto.ogg"
    Rom "That you were going to lead her into the forest, you psycho! Just like Katya."


translate english d4_school_polina_05cf235d:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/02V .ogg"
    Bya "We got here in the nick of time, eh."


translate english d4_school_polina_365ab7f7:


    "Polina's frustrated voice flew across the yard like a bird."


translate english d4_school_polina_3c42763a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/25 Da.ogg"
    Pol "What's wrong with you two?"


translate english d4_school_polina_0e7859b8:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/217Ati.ogg"
    Rom "Haven't you heard?"


translate english d4_school_polina_7cde9c1f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/219Kak.ogg"
    Rom "As soon as this asswipe moved here, people started to go missing."


translate english d4_school_polina_e44d4252:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/03 Ag.ogg"
    Bya "Yeah, I saw him offer Katya to walk her home and drag her into the forest yesterday! With my own eyes!"


translate english d4_school_polina_0e29644e:


    "I tried to retort."


translate english d4_school_polina_69d6ad23:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Vresh.ogg"
    Ant "Lies! I hated Katya!"


translate english d4_school_polina_43dadade:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/220vot.ogg"
    Rom "And that's exactly why you offed her."


translate english d4_school_polina_e19309ba:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/04 V.ogg"
    Bya "Makes sense, eh."


translate english d4_school_polina_caa5feab:


    "I was taken aback by this injustice."


translate english d4_school_polina_8b1bcbe6:


    "The only positive here was the fact that Romka and Byasha made for terrible actors. Their lies were C- at best if I were to rate them."


translate english d4_school_polina_431f22b7:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/221pov.ogg"
    Rom "You're lucky we don't deal with the cops."


translate english d4_school_polina_ce89a875:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/222ato.ogg"
    Rom "Or we would've happily reported your murdering ass."


translate english d4_school_polina_5bf84e18:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/05 N.ogg"
    Bya "It's okay! We're about to have a serious talk with him, eh."


translate english d4_school_polina_d159990e:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/06 D.ogg"
    Bya "Grab him!"


translate english d4_school_polina_8b4df86c:


    "Romka moved toward me, smirking."


translate english d4_school_polina_14cc36af:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/223zna.ogg"
    Rom "So you didn't like Katya, huh?"


translate english d4_school_polina_2b895c92:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/224kone.ogg"
    Rom "Well, of course! Who else could've offed her?"


translate english d4_school_polina_2bf07094:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/26 Ti.ogg"
    Pol "You could."


translate english d4_school_polina_d199fc7e:


    "I looked at Polina in amazement."


translate english d4_school_polina_340f12aa:


    "Romka froze in place with his fists raised."


translate english d4_school_polina_5bdde07e:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/225vsm.ogg"
    Rom "W-what do you mean?"


translate english d4_school_polina_b62141db:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/27 Ka.ogg"
    Pol "Let's be honest, Katya didn't particularly like anybody."


translate english d4_school_polina_b0d3b6ff:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/28 Du.ogg"
    Pol "Do you think she wasn't spreading rumors behind your back, Roma?"


translate english d4_school_polina_a129432f:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/29 Chto.ogg"
    Pol "About your dad's jail time? About him hitting you all the time?"


translate english d4_school_polina_e59d3087:


    "Romka's face turned red and he started flapping his lips like a fish out of water."


translate english d4_school_polina_ef5000fb:


    "Polina continued speaking in a voice that rang with anger."


translate english d4_school_polina_56580e49:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/30 A.ogg"
    Pol "And you, Byasha? Where were you yesterday evening?"


translate english d4_school_polina_6cab9eb0:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/31 Ka.ogg"
    Pol "Katya said you had a few screws loose ever since you encountered the Black Garage."


translate english d4_school_polina_0b5bebef:


    "Byasha retreated, his face became deathly white in the cavity of his hood."


translate english d4_school_polina_235ab399:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/32 Ta.ogg"
    Pol "Maybe you're the psycho who kidnapped Katya, then?"


translate english d4_school_polina_e518880d:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/07 N.ogg"
    Bya "No!"


translate english d4_school_polina_49d52c08:


    "Byasha let out a voice that almost turned into a squeal."


translate english d4_school_polina_5a96b0bf:


    "Then he turned around and wobbled his way toward the gate, shaking his head."


translate english d4_school_polina_aac15a5d:


    "\"Wow,\" I thought, \"she dealt with Byasha so easily.\""


translate english d4_school_polina_9b74f614:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/33 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "Well, what now, wanna-be-Romeo?"


translate english d4_school_polina_dd8c0e39:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/34 Ka.ogg"
    Pol "What other nasty lie will you come up with to surprise me, hm?"


translate english d4_school_polina_e4c64c5a:


    "Roma gulped, clearly discouraged."


translate english d4_school_polina_8ede217e:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/35 Ci.ogg"
    Pol "What's up with this nonsense? Did you want to play hero?"


translate english d4_school_polina_dc534fec:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/36 To.ogg"
    Pol "Heroes don't act like this."


translate english d4_school_polina_b3f76082:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/37 E.ogg"
    Pol "And boy you're a poor actor, Roma."


translate english d4_school_polina_1bb9094c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/227da.ogg"
    Rom "Listen, this four-eyes..."


translate english d4_school_polina_fc04b1f0:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/38 V.ogg"
    Pol "Is better than you in every way."


translate english d4_school_polina_c66c9d6e:


    "She said that and did the most astonishing thing: she grabbed my hand."


translate english d4_school_polina_646f6536:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/39 Po.ogg"
    Pol "Let's go, Anton."


translate english d4_school_polina_0a490a06:


    "We passed the stunned Romka."


translate english d4_school_polina_6cb1ffdf:


    "I felt somewhat bad for him, but I also obviously felt immense joy."


translate english d4_school_polina_7dac920b:


    "He didn't stop us."


translate english d4_school_polina_cfcc1f6a:


    "Just stood there and stared into the growing blizzard."


translate english d4_school_polina_8d971e58:


    "When we crossed the gates, I jumped up and exclaimed:"


translate english d4_school_polina_8adc0949:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/66. Kak.ogg"
    Ant "That was so cool!"


translate english d4_school_polina_7e0ba999:


    "Polina flashed me an embarrassed smile."


translate english d4_school_polina_1e37b43d:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/40 Nu.ogg"
    Pol "You know... As Grandpa always says: 'You live with wolves, you howl like one.'"


translate english d4_school_polina_b7ed3c77:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/67. On.ogg"
    Ant "He sounds like a philosopher."


translate english d4_school_polina_f4f3acb2:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/41 Kra.ogg"
    Pol "He's a local historian... at least he used to be."


translate english d4_school_polina_45fd9bdd:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/42 On.ogg"
    Pol "He's long retired, and lately... he's not been feeling well."


translate english d4_school_polina_95d658dc:


    "I gave her an empathetic nod."


translate english d4_school_polina_205cf682:


    "I kept sneaking glances at Polina."


translate english d4_school_polina_3b4ac06b:


    "She was like a precious gem, its sides gleaming, shimmering, changing ever so slightly."


translate english d4_school_polina_a846539f:


    "\"What?\" her eyes, full of innocent laughter, asked me."


translate english d4_school_polina_51ca9cfd:


    "\"Nothing!\" I replied without speaking."


translate english d4_school_polina_cad25acd:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/43 Ti.ogg"
    Pol "You're brave. I like it."


translate english d4_school_polina_bc6e6aa2:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/68. Hr.ogg"
    Ant "I'm brave? But I just stood there, dead silent."


translate english d4_school_polina_9e1a9bd7:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/44 No.ogg"
    Pol "True! But you didn't run."


translate english d4_school_polina_62955535:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/45 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I'm still amazed that you found the courage to talk back, not to mention hit Babruin."


translate english d4_school_polina_59c5120f:


    Ant "I'm willing to do a lot for you."


translate english d4_school_polina_8d06aef6:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/46 Vot.ogg"
    Pol "See! I told you!"


translate english d4_school_polina_2dc6f19e:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/47 Ez.ogg"
    Pol "That expression was straight out of some novel."


translate english d4_school_polina_e481f1c0:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/48 Ra.ogg"
    Pol "'For you, I'd do anything, milady!'"


translate english d4_school_polina_279d72d0:


    "Polina started giggling."


translate english d4_school_polina_b665ff3b:


    "I fake pouted, but couldn’t keep myself from smiling in the end."


translate english d4_school_solo_ee88ab6e:


    "Byasha jumped at me like that jack-in-the-box toy and yelled in my ear."


translate english d4_school_solo_a6271feb:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/171 Op.ogg"
    Bya "Lookie 'ere!"


translate english d4_school_solo_d655e8d6:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/172 Ach.ogg"
    Bya "Having a lovey-dovey time, eh?"


translate english d4_school_solo_247c070b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/247ti.ogg"
    Rom "Hey, four-eyes, are you trying to pick up Polina?"


translate english d4_school_solo_dfe0584b:


    "Polina came to my help, even though I didn't ask her to."


translate english d4_school_solo_6f7a849b:


    "Or maybe I did, with my entire appearance?"


translate english d4_school_solo_4b262130:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/174 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "What's with this nonsense? We're just friends."


translate english d4_school_solo_e2a9668a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/248Tvo.ogg"
    Rom "Is he your girlfriend, then? Do you go to buy dresses together? With this fag?"


translate english d4_school_solo_391eb38a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/175 N.ogg"
    Pol "He's not a fag! Leave Petrov alone!"


translate english d4_school_solo_9914cf4c:


    "I needed to do something, but I just sat there, clutching the edge of my desk."


translate english d4_school_solo_40db0068:


    "Romka gave me a deriding snort."


translate english d4_school_solo_b0144e58:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/249baba.ogg"
    Rom "A girl saved you, ugly face. I'll let you live. For now."


translate english d4_school_solo_5bb0e652:


    "My enemies left the classroom, guffawing."


translate english d4_school_solo_ab823c9a:


    "Polina showed me a sad smile."


translate english d4_school_solo_ba6faf82:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/176 Bu.ogg"
    Pol "Be strong."


translate english d4_school_solo_823fc34f:


    "I wanted to scream that I couldn't."


translate english d4_school_solo_c97ac007:


    "I couldn't be strong and stand up against these bastards."


translate english d4_school_solo_f6460411:


    "I couldn't stand up for myself... or anyone else."


translate english d4_school_solo_bbbfc7b1:


    "I'm pathetic."


translate english d4_school_solo_998b2133:


    "I want to disappear into the forest, dig myself into the snow. I want to go home, get under my blanket, far away from humans."


translate english d4_school_solo_a509a28d:


    "Polina left and the thoughts that were terrorizing me finally made me weep."


translate english d4_school_solo_a20cefa7:


    "..."


translate english d4_school_solo_1baf3423:


    "I stayed late after school again to escape Romka's ire for my rash act of talking to Polina."


translate english d4_school_solo_0f1cb53e:


    "Which meant I had to drag my feet toward home in the twilight."


translate english d4_school_solo_0cecea13:


    "A bored school janitor scraped his shovel against the asphalt and the upperclassmen blew out smoke that formed clouds similar to dialogue bubbles in comics."


translate english d4_school_solo_280f1d8a:


    "I wanted to fill those bubbles with friendly words, but there was nothing friendly about the icy stares those guys gave me."


translate english d4_school_solo_06c0fb9c:


    "I was leaving the unpleasant world of stale buns and nasty insults."


translate english d4_school_solo_ed0ddb1c:


    "Someone shoved me near the stairs. Didn't their parents teach them to apologize?"


translate english d4_school_solo_8fa9895d:


    "I crossed the village and slowed my pace near the bridge. I turned my head around, looking for my fox friend, but neither she nor my other new friends could be seen anywhere."


translate english d4_school_solo_9515f3cf:


    "I was met with the silent forest. It felt like a crouching predator, pretending to be asleep."


translate english d4_school_solo_a335325d:


    "It still watched me with one eye, from under half-closed eyelids, and I walked through it, my fingers gripping the backpack's straps, looking at my feet through a pair of glasses."


translate english d4_school_solo_e9ec62f5:



    voice "voice/Child/4day/Katya.ogg"
    Noname "Kaaatya! Kaaatya!"


translate english d4_school_solo_9234e4ad:


    "Once again, black shadows flashed among the naked trees, shouting the name of a girl, who was most likely already dead, over and over."


translate english d4_school_solo_826e93a6:


    "The sunset fizzled over the pine tops, like a flame from a gas burner set to a minimum."


translate english d4_school_solo_d72c52f5:


    "I walked forward, trying to hide my head in my shoulders, avoiding the sight of the crooked trees."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_597d1f5b:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/18. K.ogg"
    Ant "Sure."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_65ef2e91:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/19. To.ogg"
    Ant "But let’s head out through the back exit. The one near the gym."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_3e950ccb:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/136 Pr.ogg"
    Pol "Hiding from someone?"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_ecb2db4a:


    "I shifted my gaze to the desk in front of me."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_da606b95:


    "My buddies left us alone, giving me an ample opportunity to betray them."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_988a26fa:


    "Guilty conscience gripped my heart in its tiny jaws."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_562cbe33:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/137 Tak.ogg"
    Pol "Is this because of Romka?"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_39a4a75a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/138 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "You don’t want him to know?"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_eb29b71a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/21. T.ogg"
    Ant "He likes you."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_13d3f97b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/139 Slo.ogg"
    Pol "It’s hard not to notice."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_c01227dd:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/140 No.ogg"
    Pol "But you boys always forget the most important part: you need to ask the girl first."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_3ad7cbcf:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/141 Ade.ogg"
    Pol "And the girl is saying 'After school, near the back exit.'"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_3e728777:


    "I smiled, relieved."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_b4c675dd:


    "Guilty conscience returned to devour my heart the moment Romka came back and tossed a lingonberry bun my way, winking."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_c475be34:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/Esh.ogg"
    Rom "Eat up, you’ll need a lot of energy for our little play!"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_22817979:


    "Yet I, the actor that was supposed to play the villain, didn’t show up for that play."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_6a623c02:


    "I left the school early, twenty minutes before the algebra class was supposed to end. I lied to the teacher about having a toothache."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_a7dfd1e1:


    "I hid behind the bushes near the school, like some criminal."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_4736b656:


    "Polina soon arrived."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_3cd74bee:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/22. Ei.ogg"
    Ant "Hey, I’m here!"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_08190bd9:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/142 Tib.ogg"
    Pol "If you want to hide so badly, why not dig yourself into a snow pile?"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_1aacb29a:


    "I realized I was trying to play both sides here: secretly win Polina over without losing Romka’s support."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_d128cee2:


    "I wonder, what will happen if any of them find out about my scheme?"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_0850d2bd:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/23. Poi.ogg"
    Ant "Come on, let’s go."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_d0b5bff9:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/143 Nu.ogg"
    Pol "Okay."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_8212b122:


    "We started walking along the school’s football field."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_412703b6:


    "The sun was bright, but it did nothing to warm the frozen soil."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_26d5aba2:


    "The twilight hid in the thicket, anxiously waiting for the moment when it could come out and devour the village."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_900a755c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/24. Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I’ve already forgotten the city's bustle. This place is so tranquil."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_6c01c890:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/20 O.ogg"
    Pol "Oh, and I dream of that cacophony!"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_ace25c96:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/25. O.ogg"
    Ant "Caco... what?"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_6ac016e6:


    "My companion burst out laughing."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_3fe53318:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/21 Kak.ogg"
    Pol "A cacophony is the chaotic mixture of sounds."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_2d10daea:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/22 De.ogg"
    Pol "Grandpa always taught me to look for a melody in everything."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_b7ed3c77:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/67. On.ogg"
    Ant "He sounds like a philosopher."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_f4f3acb2:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/41 Kra.ogg"
    Pol "He's a local historian... at least he used to be."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_e166080a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/26. On.ogg"
    Ant "Your grandpa sounds cool."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_b6f755d5:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/23 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "He truly is! I’ll introduce you soon."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_2ad96f91:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/27. Ti.ogg"
    Ant "Are you inviting me to come over?"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_cfd3c3b7:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/24 A.ogg"
    Pol "You don’t want to?"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_4259214e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/28. Net.ogg"
    Ant "No! Of course, I do!"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_205cf682:


    "I kept sneaking glances at Polina."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_3b4ac06b:


    "She was like a precious gem, its sides gleaming, shimmering, changing ever so slightly."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_a846539f:


    "\"What?\" her eyes, full of innocent laughter, asked me."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_51ca9cfd:


    "\"Nothing!\" I replied without speaking."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_fa9b9a35:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/TiS.ogg"
    Pol "You’re brave. I like that."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_9db9a5b0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Smel.ogg"
    Ant "I’m brave?"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_b3b62f5a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/144 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I still remember how you fought back with Baburin!"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_3c87ae3d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/30. Pu.ogg"
    Ant "It was nothing."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_b7316e92:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/145 Zna.ogg"
    Pol "It’s very important for girls to feel safe, you know!"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_e6c73e99:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/31. Za.ogg"
    Ant "It's an honor for me to protect you."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_bc9bf51a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/146 Vot.ogg"
    Pol "See! I told you!"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_1257c57d:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/147 Ez.ogg"
    Pol "That expression was straight out of some novel."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_e5c0c899:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/148 Eto.ogg"
    Pol "It’s an honor, milady!"


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_279d72d0:


    "Polina started giggling."


translate english d4_school_fox_betray_b665ff3b:


    "I fake pouted, but couldn’t keep myself from smiling in the end."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_67590f4d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/33. Poch.ogg"
    Ant "Oh well, why not... Deal."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_f8a1f690:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/149 Togda.ogg"
    Pol "Then I’ll see you at the backyard after algebra."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_4704f65d:


    "She leaned forward and looked at me with her piercing eyes, again."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_34598843:


    "Then mumbled, as if guessing."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_201fbf08:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/18 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "Something from Musorgsky?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_104b473b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/19 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "No, probably not."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_6bf60af3:


    "Then she left, and Romka appeared in the doorway in her place. He plopped on the seat next to me and started whispering in my ear."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_ee43f8ff:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/79 Ti.ogg"
    Rom "Did you talk to her?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_7f3767b1:


    "Byasha walked toward us, but Roma stopped him with an angry glare."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_aca3f6e3:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/80 Bya.ogg"
    Rom "Byasha, shove off for a bit."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_b6c681d8:


    "Bysaha curled his lips in frustration and disappeared from the classroom."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_9c12a822:


    "Roma returned his attention to me."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_e90a36f1:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/81 Nu.ogg"
    Rom "Well? Did you?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_dd5a53eb:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/82 Ona.ogg"
    Rom "Did she say anything about me?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_a156606b:


    "I could barely stop myself from flashing a sad, desperate smile.."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_dc72f573:


    "Romka, the leader of Team Voltron was in love, madly in love!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_fd5f74b1:


    "His gaze boiled with hope, pleas, worries."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_1b3d80b0:


    "He looked like a pure, naïve boy that shielded himself from the world with sports, delinquency, and coldness."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_7c9864d3:


    "Could I really betray him in this moment of weakness?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_86355496:


    "Could I make the right choice in a situation where nothing is right?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_bf91bec6:


    "I fake coughed before speaking."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_bb5a383f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/35. Ona.ogg"
    Ant "She asked where you will be after school."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_628b18c1:


    "His face the next moment was worth the effort of telling this lie. Romka was beaming with happiness."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_9fff7b06:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/83 A.ogg"
    Rom "And what did you say?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_d6a51a75:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/36. Sk.ogg"
    Ant "I told her you’ll be in the backyard."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_e6058462:


    "Romka licked his lips in excitement. He grabbed my wrist so hard I thought it would break."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_4f3f3bbf:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/85 Nut.ogg"
    Rom "Thank you, Toha! You’re a real friend!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_37693a38:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/86 Po.ogg"
    Rom "Let’s go prepare already!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_35adf81b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/87 Sh.ogg"
    Rom "It’s gonna be a show she won't be able to forget!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_24a9d506:


    "He left the classroom to join the grouchy Byasha, and I was left alone to stare blankly at Polina’s empty seat."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_f57464f1:


    "I just traded one friendship for another."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_b13023a3:


    "Let’s just hope I made the right choice."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_a5037b9d:


    "The bell’s echo wandered aimlessly in school’s darkest corners."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_bf5dff60:


    "I flew into the yard, with my coat still half-zipped."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_b3fd8890:


    "The weather forecast didn’t lie about the coming blizzard."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_a71b184e:


    "A leaden cloud was coming at us from the North. A mighty roar bubbled inside of it."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_e7a699e3:


    "The other kids stood with their back to the wind and laughed when the gusts pushed them around the skating rink."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_472e8069:


    "The blizzard carried that laughter into the violet unknown."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_8dd5c0ea:


    "Romka rushed my way as soon as he noticed me in the tiny school backyard that was usually empty."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_508fed88:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/88 G.ogg"
    Rom "You ready? Sure you won’t chicken out?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_712ea98f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/89 V.ogg"
    Rom "There won’t be another chance."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_7bfba25a:


    "I wasn’t ready. At all."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_1a42f2b0:


    "My stomach stung, it wanted me to get out of here, to bail out from this stupid idea that was destined to fail from the very beginning."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_efd9a963:


    "But I couldn’t abandon Romka halfway through purely on principle."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_2606b440:


    "He, in the meantime, was hurriedly counting our inventory with his ink-stained fingers."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_40b5c4ac:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/90 B.ogg"
    Rom "I’ve got the bouquet."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_8443ae50:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/91 M.ogg"
    Rom "The creep is also here."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_819ea8a3:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/92 Ch.ogg"
    Rom "Do we need anything else?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_cc90f4d6:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/37.A.ogg"
    Ant "What about my costume?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_2be82097:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/37.Gde.ogg"
    Ant "Where’s my axe, or I don’t know..."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_ccd9a42e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/37.M.ogg"
    Ant "...my mask."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_2be3e561:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/93 Da.ogg"
    Rom "Oh, come on, Toha!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_c7288153:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/94 Na.ogg"
    Rom "Just put on that bunny mask you always carry around."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_18c5e83b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/95 To.ogg"
    Rom "Hurry up! We can’t let Polina see us together."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_8a20785a:


    "I looked at Romka with distrust, but my fingers already found the slider on the backpack’s zipper and tugged at it in anticipation."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_7ecade9d:


    "Instead of getting surprised, I felt relief when I took out my real \"face\"."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_659411f8:


    "With it, came calmness, the pain in my stomach subsided."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_2c529c82:


    "I instantly remembered the feeling of flight, weightlessness, and joy."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_3d865891:


    "Romka’s problems seemed so yawn-inducing and insignificant now."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_24ee1bf9:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/96 Da.ogg"
    Rom "Let’s do it like we practiced."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_517b6e3b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/97 To.ogg"
    Rom "As soon as she appears..."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_ca936995:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/38. Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I’ll stand in her way."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_bbeded7f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/98 A.ogg"
    Rom "Yeah, and I'll show up to save her from these bushes! Bam!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_b5e278e1:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/99 T.ogg"
    Rom "And you be bolder, Toshik."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_a3d94a44:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/100 Ch.ogg"
    Rom "Like it's for real."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_3e83d28c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/39. Y.ogg"
    Ant "I’ll try my best."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_10007d87:


    "This simple piece of cardboard and fur carried enough energy to compete with the blizzard’s fury."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_18b14bd2:


    "I put my real face on top of my glasses, gleeful."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_d8825a98:


    "I fixed it so my eyes would look right through the slits."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_78e21b39:


    "Romka disappeared."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_15a5ef0b:


    "In his stead, Polina walked out from around the corner, looking around warily."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_2eb27fef:


    "She had her trusty violin case with her. Fresh snow squeaked under her boots."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_55985140:


    "Clouds devoured the sun and the coming darkness turned me into a long-eared silhouette."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_1e14ca41:


    "After looking at me with suspicion, Polina started circling around the yard."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_ddbaf772:


    "Hehehe! She didn’t recognize me."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_d9529f36:


    "I stepped in front of Polina, not at all worried that my height or my clothes could give away my identity."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_71849bbf:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/40. Ti.ogg"
    Ant "{i}Are you lost, girlie?{/i} "


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_f3b7c20b:


    "She frowned and stepped back toward the bushes."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_6ed23d23:


    "Romka immediately appeared out of them, swearing."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_48d13521:


    "He moved sideways in an awkward manner, like a crab, while still hiding his hand that was holding the flowers behind his back."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_3a1fc47d:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/102E.ogg"
    Rom "Hey you, goddamn sadist!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_6b51b9ea:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/103 P.ogg"
    Rom "N-nobody will harm this girl while I’m here."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_3d5930a5:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/104 Po.ogg"
    Rom "Got it, you…?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_59d82fb7:


    "I couldn't help but cringe and rolled my eyes under the mask."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_8472bc6a:


    "Romka’s voice sounded fake and totally idiotic. He was way more believable during our rehearsal."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_b3ef2a78:


    "I paid it no mind and brazenly grabbed Polina by the collar, pulling her closer."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_3653c14e:


    "My fingers ran across her silky bangs."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_b69bd783:


    "Polina let out an angry shriek, but that only made me smirk."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_00e8fc0b:


    "I was overflowing with permissiveness and impunity."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_3bff19b8:


    "I intended to push Polina to the ground and grope her so hard I'd leave bruises, until the babbling Romka acquires proper acting skills."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_93330d21:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/106 G.ogg"
    Rom "Stay away! You hear me?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_e08f2e27:


    "I didn't listen and just kept on going, drunk on my power, on Romka's confusion that stopped him from doing anything but mumbling silently to himself."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_45abd46f:


    "And I could do anything under the guise of the Bunny."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_1db1ca93:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/41. Pro.ogg"
    Bunny "Wait for your turn, loser!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_1dc54233:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/42. S.ogg"
    Bunny "I’ll get to you when I finish with the girl."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_ffc5263e:


    "Romka’s eyes widened in surprise. I could tell he tried to keep his cool and stay true to his role for a moment."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_0499387a:


    "But before this amateur superhero could do anything, Polina intervened."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_f82069f6:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/152 Tak.ogg"
    Pol "Alright, what’s going on here?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_d81d0d4d:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/153 P.ogg"
    Pol "Pyatifan, would you get your buddy off me?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_a533d4e9:


    "Polina swung her case and hit me so hard I immediately sobered up."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_943af9dc:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/108 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "I... He’s not..."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_20a7ad95:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/155 D.ogg"
    Pol "Do you think I was born yesterday?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_d4f0035e:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/156 B.ogg"
    Pol "Is it Byasha? Or..."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_e212ff99:


    "She looked at me as if her eyes could pierce the cardboard mask."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_d0ec6310:


    "Even under the dim light around us, I could see her indignant face redden."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_50212038:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/157 An.ogg"
    Pol "Anton?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_f74bcc07:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/158 Vot.ogg"
    Pol "I thought you were better than this."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_ac8cd650:


    "I started mumbling, looking for an excuse, in wane hopes that Romka would be the first to explain everything."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_9d26f6d9:


    "But that failure of an actor just stared at a snow pile, his face red as a beet from embarrassment."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_ae0f0019:


    "Planning such a big show and screwing up even bigger!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_4fb80ada:


    "Polina watched us with her fists clutched before she suddenly shouted."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_dfc9e1c8:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/159 K.ogg"
    Pol "Clowns!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_18738e7a:


    "Her loud verdict still ricochetted off the school walls, like a trapped dove, when Polina broke into a run on the snow-covered asphalt."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_71f39b98:


    "Her shadow waved like the hem of a dress and disappeared around the corner."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_cc710a17:


    "Romka hanged his head in shame. A battered bouquet plopped down in the gray muddle of wet snow."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_1fdc2fc4:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/109 E.ogg"
    Rom "We've screwed up big time, bro!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_51627011:


    "I took off the mask from my sweaty face. The wind cooled my skin."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_bcac9f74:


    "It felt like along with the mask I took off a layer of intrusive thoughts and emotions."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_f7cf369e:


    "Romka screeched with his teeth, staring down at his feet."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_b23f68fd:


    "Lost and depressed, he couldn’t counter fate’s punches, unlike me."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_953e97b7:


    "I knew how terrible he felt."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_a8640f29:


    "He was ready to crush everything around him, or bang his head against the concrete."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_4962a73e:


    "He was ready to do anything but ask Polina to come back."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_4b06b5c7:


    "He was strong and brave, but his fear of showing any weakness impeded him greatly."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_42ee8352:


    "A possible resolution flashed in my mind. I placed my hand on Romka’s shoulder."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_ef23fed9:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/45. Z.ogg"
    Ant "Wait here."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_bedc0abd:


    "I sprinted across the schoolyard, trying to catch up to Polina."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_8bf017d5:


    "An echo followed my footsteps."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_f5e278a9:


    "The girl’s violin case swayed like a tail of an annoyed cat."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_121aba66:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/46. Pol.ogg"
    Ant "Polina!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_f688114e:


    "She slowed down, but didn’t turn around."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_0b2b82f7:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/47. Nu.ogg"
    Ant "Polina, please!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_6265d2c6:


    "I could finally see her pretty profile."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_5540ef70:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/160 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "What?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_070512c1:


    "I caught up to her and carefully grabbed her by the elbow. She didn’t yank it away, it was a good sign."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_62c48d50:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/48. Ti.ogg"
    Ant "It was all just a big misunderstanding."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_10f0d5ec:


    "Polina brushed a lock of hair off her face."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_15d84ae4:


    "I thought that she probably stole that move from one of the Sharon Stone movies."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_cbbbab5b:


    "Her voice was still strict."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_42066b35:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/161 Ct.ogg"
    Pol "What’s there to misunderstand?!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_20e1a2db:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/162 R.ogg"
    Pol "Romka planned some heroic deed, well, in his own world."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_a413457c:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/163 At.ogg"
    Pol "And you offered to be the clown he would protect me from."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_2f310fbf:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/164 Es.ogg"
    Pol "He even managed to find a mask this ugly somewhere!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_4ebb71b6:


    "I wanted to shout: {i}\"It’s not ugly at all!\"{/i} but said something completely different, instead."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_89a97bf0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/49. Avot.ogg"
    Ant "And that’s where you’re wrong!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_7e5ee5eb:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/50 T.ogg"
    Ant "Romka really likes you."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_7a2e247f:


    "Curiosity flashed in her eyes."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_a50d5f34:


    "I wanted to hug Polina, steal her, and lead her into the forest."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_b6d949d7:


    "I wanted to introduce her to my new friends."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_6e220332:


    "I wanted the flute to sing. Polina would have surely liked its melody."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_c678e495:


    "I wanted us to jump high in the sky, above the clouds."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_7becb46c:


    "There, under the stars that are pinned to the night sky, I would tell Polina how much I needed her."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_82495bbb:


    "That she’s like water and I’m dying from thirst."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_3b2f8c60:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/166 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I thought you also liked me."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_ad8e285b:


    "I played dumb."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_78388682:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/50. Mne.ogg"
    Ant "Me?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_1e161082:


    "Polina fought out of my clutches, annoyed."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_9791d832:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/168 Vs.ogg"
    Pol "I get it now!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_eec5278b:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/51.Da.ogg"
    Ant "Wait, wait! I do like you!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_ed12e6af:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/51.T.ogg"
    Ant "Everybody does."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_61edf533:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/51.No.ogg"
    Ant "But Romka is a special case."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_18455e4f:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/169 Os.ogg"
    Pol "The special case of a liar."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_f4bc68dd:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/52. On.ogg"
    Ant "He’s determined and he’s actually way more serious than he looks."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_91109821:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/52.Po.ogg"
    Ant "Remember how you told me about wanting to escape? You’d definitely be able to do that with him."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_fe5e4b6e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/52.V.ogg"
    Ant "He'd take you to some big, shiny city."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_3472ef45:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/52.Da.ogg"
    Ant "Hell, he'd take you wherever you want!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_abb83b2c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/52.On.ogg"
    Ant "He swore to protect you."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_8f027430:


    "Polina stared into the darkness outside the school’s boundaries. There was only the wind and the swirling snow."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_1d10a240:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/170 E.ogg"
    Pol "And what do you want me to do?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_c36a703f:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/171 Ot.ogg"
    Pol "Bear children from his oaths?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_f7cdd51f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/52.Dl.ogg"
    Ant "Just give him a chance, get to know him better."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_4541ab0d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/53.Sh.ogg"
    Ant "Jokes aside, the real serial killer is still on the loose."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_50ed1f2c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/53.Po.ogg"
    Ant "Let Romka escort you home today."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_766ffc46:


    "I forced myself to speak, but my lips went numb and my face turned to stone."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_12607e8e:


    "I was afraid that my voice would give away my true feelings."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_af9aa0dd:


    "Words were like razors that cut my chest and my windpipe before scattering out of my mouth."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_133e1c45:


    "Polina stayed silent for what felt like an eternity and beyond."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_56d66d09:


    "She snored angrily and tapped her fingers on the black violin case."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_3614a427:


    "Finally, she sighed and spoke."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_5f391a9e:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/172 Pe.ogg"
    Pol "Tell your Romka that I’ll be waiting near the school gates."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_ebdee67b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/173 no.ogg"
    Pol "But don’t let him get the wrong Idea!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_3203d220:


    "I feigned happiness. I could fake emotions if need be."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_09f89631:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/54. T.ogg"
    Ant "You won’t regret it."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_c75837ad:


    "I slowly shuffled my way around the corner, my eyes shut tight and my heart beating like a hammer that drove nails deep into my soul."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_d45d4a5e:


    "Romka sat in a squatting position, ruffling his short hair."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_e7f0bde6:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/55. Ona.ogg"
    Ant "She’s waiting for you at the gate."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_447f91d3:


    "I was rewarded with the amazed look on my buddy’s face."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_a0b2083c:


    "He sprang up, choking on words."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_82102c1f:


    "Total opposite of the shut-off silent leader that I met just last week."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_eafae180:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/111 T.ogg"
    Rom "Tosha, you’re my savior!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_3f94f738:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/112 B.ogg"
    Rom "Bro, I’m in your debt forever."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_5374187b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/113H.ogg"
    Rom "Do you want me to fetch you a Tetris console? Or maybe teach you how to fist fight?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_21de0a2d:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/114 E.ogg"
    Rom "Or..."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_447c29d6:


    "I only had one dream: to be left alone."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_41c0479e:


    "So I could watch the forest sway in the wind in complete silence."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_49422d7f:


    "So I could breathe in the frosty smell through the old mask."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_640335db:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/56. Ed.ogg"
    Ant "Go already."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_643a9669:


    "I hoped that, when it comes to Alisa, I won’t need to choose between friendship and my feelings."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_30bf3170:


    "I have no one left apart from her..."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_2d5d93dd:


    "...well, maybe also Olya."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_1c8e7945:


    "But of course, she was my only ray of light in this pitch-black Taiga."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_7c4c0b5d:


    "How could I forget about my little sister?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_bd182794:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/57. Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I know what I want."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_2f59ea75:


    "Romka, who already started walking, stopped and looked at me."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_0cd62da7:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/58. Y.ogg"
    Ant "I want to go to Disneyland with my sister."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_6d427f17:


    "My buddy smirked and pulled his hat to the back of his head."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_2888cb1a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/116 E.ogg"
    Rom "And what do you suggest?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_57caefed:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/117 S.ogg"
    Rom "We rob a bank or something?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_f8af47c8:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/59.Ne.ogg"
    Ant "No, we just need to catch that serial killer."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_6b654377:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/60.To.ogg"
    Ant "The one that’s responsible for all the kidnappings."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_44d26a6e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/60.E.ogg"
    Ant "Then we’ll get that reward from the police."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_5a2bdf1b:


    "Romka winced and hid his hands in the pockets of his pants."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_a593dc05:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/118 D.ogg"
    Rom "You really think the lieutenant will pay you for helping out?"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_7ddf4d7b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/119 Po.ogg"
    Rom "The best you’ll get is probably an officer’s watch or something!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_50fff925:


    "I got tired of arguing with Romka."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_2d4bd537:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/60. Ti.ogg"
    Ant "Will you help me? Yes, or no."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_862d4bdf:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/120 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "I’ve already told you, we’re a team."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_c4de9798:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/121 K.ogg"
    Rom "We move together."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_c50213fe:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/60.Ho.ogg"
    Ant "Good."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_090728aa:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/60.Te.ogg"
    Ant "If only we knew where to start..."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_0fc81ef7:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/122 S.ogg"
    Rom "Wait up!"


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_f8c3b8e8:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/123 By.ogg"
    Rom "Byasha said he heard someone crying in the windfall behind the cemetery."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_b2829d5e:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/124 G.ogg"
    Rom "I bet it was Katya."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_bed8b679:


    "I tensed up like a guitar string."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_01067e00:


    "Katya was a step toward Semyon, and he was a step toward Vova."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_2b2a41b3:


    "We’ll help the police arrest that accursed killer and our village would stop living in fear."


translate english d4_school_fox_voltron_c316a343:


