    "The Garage’s doors were open. Darkness swirled inside it."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_a303082c:


    "I felt someone’s touch; Romka put his palm on my shoulder."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_5168fe0b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/167 po.ogg"
    Rom "Are we going?"


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_17830e4e:


    "He looked far older than his real age. Actually, he looked like a decrepit old man."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_06b06def:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Kuda.ogg"
    Ant "Where? Are you insane!?"


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_54004e6a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Davai.ogg"
    Ant "Let’s go warn Lt. Tikhonov."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_fe6cb9bd:


    "Romka spat at his feet."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_1cc0b609:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/169 Ne.ogg"
    Rom "Don’t be silly, Toha."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_5185e1b5:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/170 T.ogg"
    Rom "Your Tikhonov couldn’t even find a mitten in the forest, haha."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_280db1d6:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/171Da.ogg"
    Rom "And helping the cops is for pussies, especially now when I’m on their juvenile criminal list..."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_740dd6b4:


    "The delinquent brandished his trademark knife and looked at me."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_4636615c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/172 m.ogg"
    Rom "The serial killer has probably returned to his lair."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_c4a3c302:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/173 E.ogg"
    Rom "We might catch him off-guard and capture him."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_87bb62e4:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/174 En.ogg"
    Rom "Or next time he'll be the one ambushing us."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_9b3d1ffc:


    "The animal kids said he was just a man from the village..."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_c8100ccc:


    "But can we beat him by ourselves?"


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_408a92e1:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/175 V.ogg"
    Rom "There may not be a second chance, bro."


translate english d4_byash_choice_call_0cffac99:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/176 T.ogg"
    Rom "Time to decide!"


translate english d4_garage_choice_police_3136da68:


    "Hoarse laughter could be heard from inside the garage. It made my hair stand on end."


translate english d4_garage_choice_police_828d56d3:


    "In reality, it was just the sound of a massive black door squeaking in the cold wind."


translate english d4_garage_choice_police_55f34132:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Eto.ogg"
    Ant "I’m sure this is some sort of trap."


translate english d4_garage_choice_police_c133d279:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Net.ogg"
    Ant "No, Roma, we’re not going inside without the police."


translate english d4_garage_choice_police_53899a94:


    "The already sour face of my companion wrinkled as if he bit into a lemon."


translate english d4_garage_choice_police_9fc03e23:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/177 x.ogg"
    Rom "Ah, whatever!"


translate english d4_garage_choice_police_4ba53f9b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/178 To.ogg"
    Rom "Let me tell you, though… Cops are worse than bandits."


translate english mold_test2_a273edf9:


    "We got closer to the building."


translate english mold_test2_bbf3dd62:


    "The metal box was completely silent, apart from the generator's hum."


translate english mold_test2_3ce16d64:


    "Romka knocked on the gate with his knuckles, as if to make sure it’s not going to turn into a predatory maw."


translate english mold_test2_fb7965cb:


    "With newfound confidence, he opened the gate wider, and started feeling around the wall, looking for the light switch."


translate english mold_test2_a1c06f5c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/182 Toh.ogg"
    Rom "Toha, give me a hand here."


translate english mold_test2_a20cefa7:


    "..."


translate english mold_test2_db2c1c70:


    "It turned out to be an ordinary garage on the inside."


translate english mold_test2_4e6f3ebe:


    "Tool shelves on both sides, canisters, rags, and a covered car."


translate english mold_test2_19701324:


    "No serial killers. No murder victims."


translate english mold_test2_b85e32f9:


    "I even chuckled in relief. Similar emotions could be read from my companion’s face."


translate english mold_test2_f1a89ef7:


    "Romka entered the garage and went clockwise around the car."


translate english mold_test2_82b054da:


    "He rummaged through the dusty shelves, then looked at me."


translate english mold_test2_474ec482:


    "I got brave enough to set one foot inside the garage."


translate english mold_test2_696bd909:


    "Darkness was plastered all over its corners like a spider web. But if there ever was a spider here, it left its nest a long time ago."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_tools_676b2bfc:


    "Just a bunch of tools."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_tools_a4cbb095:


    "Rusty tools that look like steel fangs inside the jaws of this icy place or like torture tools of a medieval executioner."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_tools_2a7be849:


    "The moment you touch these, a wound will bloom on your finger, and the resulting cut will get infected from the rust and the dried fat, and you'll rot away alive."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_tools_32930ff9:


    "There's also something scarlet on those pincers. I need to go and check... Paint. It's just paint."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_junk_b5062338:


    "Just a pile of junk."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_junk_e813d3dc:


    "Why does this look so much like an altar? As in, the Garage is a church, and these here are the attributes of an inhuman taiga religion..."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_junk_16e4d3e7:


    "I don't want to look at the icons of that beastly faith! Ancient scriptures and iron relics. "


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_junk_d85744f8:


    "No, it's just a pile of junk!"


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_junk_72c5b563:


    "Nobody is worshipped here, shrines like these don't exist! And there's some wax on the tabletop because they often have blackouts and the owner works in candlelight."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_boxes_097ef2fd:


    "Boxes. Nothing more."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_boxes_3f7b9637:


    "Severed limbs, mounds of ground meat, and heads, plastered with meat flies. I'll see all of that inside this box."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_boxes_fdd0eae6:


    "Just like in a nightmare: a scary version of \"The Field of Wonders\" where the host pulls out pus-oozing prizes out of a black box."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_boxes_4783b8de:


    "In reality, the box was empty. Even if there was something inside, it was probably taken out at some point."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_car_26b1bd15:


    "This is a car. What else can it be?"


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_car_8b83e655:


    "It's a car. What else can it be? Just a car covered with a tarp. There was nobody inside it. No dead, no living. The stench of dried-up blood..."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_car_d6fc7477:


    "It's all in my head. The thing under the cover smells like machine oil, nothing more."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_tiski_c931d7de:


    "What a sturdy vise."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_tiski_b55fe5da:


    "What did it grip? What crunched under the pressure of its metal maws? What poured down on the workbench from the ripping flesh? Its cast iron parts crumbled from continued use."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_tiski_8290cfa7:


    "But it was just a normal metalwork vise, we had one just like this in our shop classroom. A vise for metal parts, not for victims. Drops of oil, not blood."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_shelf_8860abfa:


    "Just a dusty shelf."


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_shelf_53fc3d5b:


    "The surrounding dim light couldn't reach there. Anything could be hidden in the dark. What if someone is watching me from there, hiding behind silvery webs? Let me stand on my tip-toes... "


translate english d4_garage_lookaround_shelf_5f13944b:


    "No, nothing but dust and old junk."


translate english d4_garage_followup_91dcf95c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/183 r.ogg"
    Rom "Ugh, nothing but rusty junk!"


translate english d4_garage_followup_eff7be55:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/184 ok.ogg"
    Rom "This place turned out to be boring as fuck."


translate english d4_garage_followup_c0ee07ab:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/185 K.ogg"
    Rom "What kind of moron had the bright idea to move this garage from place to place all the time?"


translate english d4_garage_followup_76b71c8e:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/186 Po.ogg"
    Rom "We’re leaving."


translate english d4_garage_followup_0432436d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/10 Aga.ogg"
    Ant "Okay!"


translate english d4_garage_followup_9f213072:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/10 Da.ogg"
    Ant "Let’s catch up with Byasha, he got it really bad."


translate english d4_garage_followup_538678fb:


    "I went out into the snowfall."


translate english d4_garage_followup_f5c1755b:


    "Romka was also stomping toward the exit when he suddenly stopped and stared at the car."


translate english d4_garage_followup_004612cf:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/187 S.ogg"
    Rom "Hey, why leave this place empty-handed?"


translate english d4_garage_followup_4cf153bb:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/188 D.ogg"
    Rom "Lemme at least snatch the tape deck."


translate english d4_garage_followup_993097f6:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/189 O.ogg"
    Rom "I’ll be back in a jiffy."


translate english d4_garage_followup_a29657d2:


    "Somebody sniffled from under the cover."


translate english d4_garage_followup_26d83f60:


    "I almost plopped into a snow pile from surprise."


translate english d4_garage_followup_b1b6222a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/190 T.ogg"
    Rom "Did you hear that? It’s her!"


translate english d4_garage_followup_46683a49:


    "I watched my friend tugging at the cloth, but I couldn’t muster the strength to rush to his aid."


translate english d4_garage_followup_1217ed2b:


    "My legs froze into the round."


translate english d4_garage_followup_32710e2a:


    "Still, Romka managed even without me. The cover he slashed with his knife flew to the side."


translate english d4_garage_followup_ef9f8b54:


    "There was no car underneath it."


translate english d4_garage_followup_e7206274:


    "Instead, as if growing out of the floor, there stood a huge meat grinder, sparkling with its well-oiled parts."


translate english d4_garage_followup_d5fa16a3:


    "I saw one just like this in {u}\"Under Sixteen and Beyond \"{/u}."


translate english d4_garage_followup_d6668a4d:


    "An industrial giant that factories used to grind cow carcasses when making sausage."


translate english d4_garage_followup_89fcf962:


    "Inside its bowl, which reminded me of the bloodthirsty maws of a Venus flytrap, sat a tied-up Katya."


translate english d4_garage_followup_c8eae1aa:


    "She looked like she just snapped out of a daydream, and her eyes rounded in horror. The gag in Katya's mouth prevented her from doing anything but moaning and sniffling."


translate english d4_garage_followup_459fd937:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/191 S.ogg"
    Rom "Get over here!"


translate english d4_garage_followup_51449647:


    "I threw off my stupor like a heavy tarp and rushed inside the garage."


translate english d4_garage_followup_41478872:


    "In the meantime, Romka almost managed to climb the steel death machine. He grabbed Katya under her shoulders and…"


translate english d4_garage_followup_8b7be8cd:


    "He must've pressed some sort of button with his knee."


translate english d4_garage_followup_e8b7d976:


    "The mechanism started rumbling like an empty stomach."


translate english d4_garage_followup_2ba2fe6c:


    "Romka realized what he had done so he screamed."


translate english d4_garage_followup_94b1e4b3:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/192 Ch.ogg"
    Rom "Fuck! Turn it off! Turn it off!"


translate english d4_garage_followup_2a57e4c5:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/11 Yas.ogg"
    Ant "Okay! Hang in there!"


translate english d4_garage_followup_131ef294:


    "It’s no use!"


translate english d4_garage_followup_34ee3d7f:


    "Not a single damn button or a switch helped in stopping those horrible screeching wheels."


translate english d4_garage_followup_f29ac563:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/12 Nera.ogg"
    Ant "It’s not working! I can’t do shit!"


translate english d4_garage_followup_16e3b06a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/193 Ta.ogg"
    Rom "Get your ass over here, then!"


translate english d4_garage_followup_a66c9835:


    "We bent toward Katya and tried to pull her out by the elbow."


translate english d4_garage_followup_09eda2dc:


    "The spirals on the bottom got to work. They slowly winded up, gathering more and more speed with every turn."


translate english d4_garage_followup_09218290:


    "Then came the crunching sound. Like that of a flame eating away at firewood."


translate english sK1_good_89d226dd:


    "Katya wailed through the gag."


translate english sK1_good_b50ae41a:


    "But the grinder didn’t let go. It started to feast."


translate english sK1_good_406ad609:


    "I screamed when I saw Katya’s squashed legs getting wrapped around the grinder blades."


translate english sK1_good_ca1e6e79:


    "They looked like a pair of tattered stockings now."


translate english sK1_good_d182f8b5:


    "Her bones pierced the skin and poked out like pointy twigs."


translate english sK1_good_c145da1c:


    "A white kneecap floated around in the crimson syrup."


translate english sK1_good_a349de4b:


    "I was trying to pull Katya out but I could tell I was losing."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_fcf2fddb:


    "The blades crushed her pelvis. The bloody gravy bubbled up."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_4d52f0fa:


    "Katya kept wailing, holding the same maddening note."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_4982f406:


    "Her eyes, bloodshot from all the burst blood vessels, popped out of their sockets. The blades reached her stomach."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_2310e943:


    "They scooped up the glaucous tubes of intestines with ease."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_6db0836a:


    "Just like Olya wrapped spaghetti around her fork. The stench of entrails spread through the garage."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_b7557614:


    "I stopped trying to help Katya. She was clearly too far gone already."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_dd0bd106:


    "The girl’s head dangled helplessly. Her murky eyes stared into space."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_c94714f8:


    "The meat grinder chewed through Katya’s ribcage and devoured her barely formed breasts."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_89e41806:


    "Her face darkened due to rising blood pressure. Scarlet streams ran from her eyes and ears."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_ec07fb46:


    "Katya was dead, but the machine had no intention of stopping."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_48025163:


    "Hair got tangled in the blades and a scalp got separated from Katya's skull with a loud smacking sound."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_85a0bc7b:


    "The skin on her face slid down, the death grimace made me stagger away."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_5f8165e7:


    "I felt a pair of hands on my body and I thought that I was also about to get thrown into the bowl as a dessert."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_04251cf7:


    "I was about to become a part of the same mincemeat mass as Katya."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_7d234027:


    "But it was Romka dragging me away."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_a5f37d8e:


    "From the mechanism’s metal trunk, a thick blood-filled sausage with hair and bones mixed in plopped into the tray."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_4b5c0763:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/250 Mi.ogg"
    Rom "We did all we could..."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_bf6c7e0d:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/197 N.ogg"
    Rom "We need to get out of here."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_f322e321:


    "I unzipped my backpack with ice-cold fingers."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_434c3169:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/198 Ti.ogg"
    Rom "Are you insane?"


translate english d4_save_katya_after_2e662d22:


    "I lifted the Polaroid and wiped the tears off my face with my sleeve."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_7a0d2766:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/14 Nam.ogg"
    Ant "We need proof."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_ef33aa9e:


    "The blades almost finished chewing up the bones."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_f6f699c2:


    "A torn-out braid dangled from one of the steel teeth."


translate english d4_save_katya_after_21466eac:


    "I took aim, got the hairband with a plastic strawberry in the frame."


translate english d4_garage_photo_b3fe7568:


    "Click."


translate english d4_garage_photo_ba7c80e1:


    "The braid fell inside the grinder. The giant machine stopped after letting out one last gurgle."


translate english d4_garage_photo_d8357ea0:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/194 Ka.ogg"
    Rom "Why the fuck did you just stand there?!"


translate english d4_garage_photo_fbcf10b5:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/195 m.ogg"
    Rom "We could’ve saved her..."


translate english d4_garage_photo_19eae413:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/196 V.ogg"
    Rom "Man, I had no idea you hated her that much."


translate english d4_garage_photo_bf6c7e0d:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/197 N.ogg"
    Rom "We need to get out of here."


translate english d4_garage_photo_33b01cdb:


    "We stumbled out of the garage."


translate english d4_garage_photo_2edf6182:


    "I grabbed a handful of snow and shoved it in my mouth. Then chewed on the mushy substance."


translate english d4_garage_photo_22031de7:


    "Roma was on his knees, wiping his face with snow."


translate english d4_garage_photo_4adaaefb:


    "I crawled away from the monstrous meat grinder, clinging to the ice with my nails."


translate english d4_garage_photo_bb753023:


    "I coughed as if trying to expectorate the memory of what I saw."


translate english d4_garage_photo_2e66c4c3:


    "But I knew that I’d never forget the smell, the sound of breaking bones, and Katya’s agony."


translate english d4_garage_photo_eed0cb29:


    "Roma crawled up to me on all fours and, for a moment, I felt like he lost his sanity from horror."


translate english d4_garage_photo_df6f281e:


    "And now he was going to tear into my throat, like a wild beast."


translate english d4_garage_photo_c4ce8133:


    "Instead, he grabbed my coat and started scrubbing scarlet drops from my sleeve with snow."


translate english d4_garage_photo_0b52d536:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/17 Chto.ogg"
    Ant "What are you doing?"


translate english d4_garage_photo_1578b1e1:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/200 N.ogg"
    Rom "We can’t let anybody know."


translate english d4_garage_photo_4201ff68:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Ochem.ogg"
    Ant "What do you mean?"


translate english d4_garage_photo_7bc52ad8:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/201 N.ogg"
    Rom "No going to the police, got it?"


translate english d4_garage_photo_d1a917c3:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/202 Ka.ogg"
    Rom "We’re clearly not gluing Katya back together."


translate english d4_garage_photo_92641a8f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/203 A.ogg"
    Rom "And I don’t want to end up in jail like my old man."


translate english d4_garage_photo_218252f5:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/18 no.ogg"
    Ant "But you said..."


translate english d4_garage_photo_27a4a094:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/204 G.ogg"
    Rom "Right, I did."


translate english d4_garage_photo_c7cdd8d4:


    "He threw a hateful glare at the Garage."


translate english d4_garage_photo_4d1c52ee:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/205 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "I turned on the meat grinder."


translate english d4_garage_photo_4e51021c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/19 Nech.ogg"
    Ant "By accident!"


translate english d4_garage_photo_4dfaf325:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/206 Pop.ogg"
    Rom "Try and prove that."


translate english d4_garage_photo_83f2d107:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/207Em.ogg"
    Rom "They just need a scapegoat for all these killings."


translate english d4_garage_photo_26a3fa5e:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/208Ya.ogg"
    Rom "I’ll be behind bars, and the serial killer will walk free."


translate english d4_garage_photo_6d17bb02:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/209 Bl.ogg"
    Rom "Fuck! And my life was just starting to get better…!"


translate english d4_garage_photo_4bcbc43d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/20 No.ogg"
    Ant "But we can’t just..."


translate english d4_garage_photo_77792c3a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/210 M.ogg"
    Rom "We can! Swear you won’t tell anybody!"


translate english d4_garage_photo_93374c0e:


    "He didn’t say the \"Or else…\" part out loud, but his tone of voice clearly had that implication."


translate english d4_garage_photo_77b833f3:


    "I stayed silent for a minute. I spent it thinking about the bloody gravy that was flowing out of the machine."


translate english d4_garage_photo_44911975:


    "Roma was right."


translate english d4_garage_photo_00f288a8:


    "Even if Tikhonov believes us, the Garage might be gone by that time."


translate english d4_garage_photo_ba456dd4:


    "It will just magically teleport to some other clearing on the other side of this damn forest."


translate english d4_garage_photo_ef0737cd:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/212 Po.ogg"
    Rom "Please."


translate english d4_garage_photo_a5fc74dc:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/213 Kt.ogg"
    Rom "Someone has to protect Polina."


translate english d4_garage_photo_500badc7:


    "\"Olya, too,\" I thought while nodding slowly."


translate english d4_garage_photo_4f9310ee:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/21 Horo.ogg"
    Ant "Okay."


translate english d4_garage_photo_6d834150:


    "I was afraid I wouldn’t be able to keep my word."


translate english d4_garage_photo_dbe02943:


    "That mom will read it off my face, that she will notice the blood drops, or sense the smell."


translate english d4_garage_photo_b4d6321b:


    "And I’ll crack, I’ll just fall on the floor before her and start wailing, scared for myself and my family."


translate english d4_garage_photo_1ff02d4f:


    "At that moment, I had no idea what was actually waiting for me in the place I mistakenly called home."


translate english d4_police_entry_c2152e79:


    "Inside, the police station was permeated by the smell of {u}chebureki{/u} and cigarette smoke."


translate english d4_police_entry_732fe0c4:


    "From the depths of it, a muffled voice of Tatyana Bulanova could be heard."


translate english d4_police_entry_a83d30ea:


    "I thought that it should be impossible to work with such a tear-jerking ambiance. The atmosphere was fit for a funeral."


translate english d4_police_lookaround_cage_566172d7:


    "\"Monkey house\". What a weird name..."


translate english d4_police_lookaround_cage_7b1c6fe7:


    "I've heard Dad mention a \"Monkey house\" before. It's a cell where they hold criminals right after catching them."


translate english d4_police_lookaround_cage_6963cbc3:


    "Its thick metal bars looked scary, just like in the movies. I even got the urge to draw this place. I took a moment to imagine who I would put inside the cage for my drawing."


translate english d4_police_lookaround_cage_fcfe3787:


    "Romka immediately came to mind. He would definitely look good behind bars!"


translate english d4_police_lookaround_mask_bf306da7:


    "Just an old gas mask."


translate english d4_police_lookaround_mask_f33d9e0a:


    "An old gas mask hung from the nearby chair. Good to know that the police remember about safety drills! Only... where's the filter?"


translate english d4_police_lookaround_mask_74ba0416:


    "Or do they use this gas mask for something else here..?"


translate english d4_police_followup_e231e586:


    "I shook my head, chasing away grim thoughts. Then took off my hat and stroked my hand against my ruffled hair."


translate english d4_police_followup_2f7e652a:


    "Snow thawed off my soles, leaving wet prints on the tiles."


translate english d4_police_followup_79697e4b:


    "The clock ticked loudly, and the children who perished in the night looked at us from the \"Attention! Wanted!\" board."


translate english d4_police_followup_a9a18b2d:


    "Nearby, among the printed photos of criminals, was the composite sketch I drew."


translate english d4_police_followup_ba28b4d1:


    "The composite sketch I drew wasn’t among the printed photos of criminals."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_ccd92193:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/68 Ba.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Now that’s a face I didn’t expect to see!"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_501d4092:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/69 Chto.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Hey, Pyatifanov, did you come to turn yourself in?"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_7418241f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/179 o.ogg"
    Rom "Very funny..."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_1eba100f:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/70 Da.ogg"
    Tikhonov "You’re right, not the best time for jokes."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_5d98b101:


    "The policeman shifted his heavy gaze to me."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_404a0376:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/13 T.ogg"
    Tikhonov "You should be careful when picking your friends, Petrov. We barely know each other, but you’ve already gotten into trouble."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_0b332af1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/14 Na.ogg"
    Tikhonov "You’ll end up on the juvenile criminal list, just like him…"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_8152c35a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/148 O.ogg"
    Rom "Yeah, we all know how you put people on those lists. You'd do anything for a successful report."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_57f2d703:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/149 A.ogg"
    Rom "And the real criminals are still free!"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_c3342bd1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/15 No.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Hey!"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_e62dc1ec:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/16 Sm.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Listen here! If you don't set yourself straight, you’ll end up in juvenile detention, just like your dad."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_890c8f6f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/150 A.ogg"
    Rom "Oh, I’ll surprise you alright!"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_f1d59b1e:


    "I realized it was time to intervene before Tikhonov loses his patience."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_8338cee2:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/05 Ko.ogg"
    Ant "Konstantin Vladimirovich, you need to come with us!"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_dc1014aa:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/06 M.ogg"
    Ant "We’ve found a garage."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_795405c1:


    "I already knew how he would react."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_469be5c6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/75 Von.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Is that so? A garage, huh?"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_da5019ed:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/76 Da.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Let me guess… Does it contain {u}Stenka Razin’s{/u} treasures?"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_0819c416:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/78. Net.ogg"
    Ant "No, but…"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_06133775:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/22 Pe.ogg"
    Tikhonov "My, oh my, Petrov… Be honest with me. It wasn’t your idea, right?"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_71373068:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/23 P.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Pyatifanov put you up to this, didn’t he? It’s all just a game to him."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_44d93692:


    "Romka rolled his eyes."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_166ae299:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/180 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "Told you so..."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_ad06657e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/79. Nek.ogg"
    Ant "Nobody put me up to this!"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_6638c248:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Yasam.ogg"
    Ant "I saw it myself! Just like I can see you right now! It was in the forest, among the stumps..."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_3307c4b0:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/79 Vr.ogg"
    Tikhonov "It was just a makeshift hut, Anton."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_217a9c5a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/07 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "No, it was a garage!"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_197e28e1:


    "The senior lieutenant raised his hands in surrender."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_8d2bd42c:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/80 Ti.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Do you even know what a makeshift hut looks like?"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_ed74a94a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/08 Nu.ogg"
    Ant "Well… I mean…"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_7536e705:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/81 Ne.ogg"
    Tikhonov "You don’t! How could you tell them apart, then?"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_1af7a2b6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/82 Oh.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Local hunters had built that hut to store supplies."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_279e8f08:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/83 Mi.ogg"
    Tikhonov "We’ve checked at least ten of those while scouring the forest."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_d882bfe1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/84 E.ogg"
    Tikhonov "And we most likely also ransacked the one you mentioned... I mean, we checked what's inside."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_46dd44c0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/09 Hi.ogg"
    Ant "Huts don’t eat children! But the Black Garage does!"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_4940a9e5:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/85 Ch.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Black Garage?"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_de1ce25d:


    "Tikhonov thought for a bit, drumming his fingers against the table that had a stack of papers on top."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_a127d8a1:


    "I had a faint hope that the lieutenant will take my words seriously."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_5ded9150:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/86 Na.ogg"
    Tikhonov "On a pitch black street... In a pitch-black alleyway..."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_5056c312:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/87 Che.ogg"
    Tikhonov "A pitch black garage..."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_785916d9:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/88 Hv.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Gotcha!"


translate english d4_police_voluntary_8bd5b102:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/181P.ogg"
    Rom "Here we go again..."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_77d29e80:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/89 He.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Hahaha, see? I still remember that children’s horror story."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_bcb74a7e:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/90 Po.ogg"
    Tikhonov "I scared my younger sister to death with that tale when I was a kid. That silly girl had trouble sleeping for three nights straight."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_e2bf4544:


    "Tikhonov smiled, flashing rows of sturdy teeth, and I remembered my Olya."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_8e0799f2:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/91 Ba.ogg"
    Tikhonov "It’s just an urban legend, boys. A very old one, to boot."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_52d86f9d:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/92 V.ogg"
    Tikhonov "You’ll be telling it to your children, and they’ll pass it down to their children."


translate english d4_police_voluntary_945436c5:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/93 Ne.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Some stories... Especially the nasty ones... Seem to live on forever."


translate english d4_police_forced_54925fea:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/09 R.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Take a seat."


translate english d4_police_forced_1be2271a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/10 Ati.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Where do you think you’re sitting, Pyatifanov? There’s a special place for you, in the cell over there."


translate english d4_police_forced_e1264f7c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/147 A.ogg"
    Rom "Why me? What did I do?"


translate english d4_police_forced_3929a55d:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/11 Na.ogg"
    Tikhonov "You charged at the officer on duty with a knife."


translate english d4_police_forced_54f83400:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/12 Teb.ogg"
    Tikhonov "You think that's not enough?"


translate english d4_police_forced_5d98b101:


    "The policeman shifted his heavy gaze to me."


translate english d4_police_forced_404a0376:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/13 T.ogg"
    Tikhonov "You should be careful when picking your friends, Petrov. We barely know each other, but you’ve already gotten into trouble."


