translate english d4_police_forced_57f2d703:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/149 A.ogg"
    Rom "And the real criminals are still free!"


translate english d4_police_forced_c3342bd1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/15 No.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Hey!"


translate english d4_police_forced_e62dc1ec:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/16 Sm.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Listen here! If you don't set yourself straight, you’ll end up in juvenile detention, just like your dad."


translate english d4_police_forced_890c8f6f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/150 A.ogg"
    Rom "Oh, I’ll surprise you alright!"


translate english d4_police_forced_18c80ffb:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/17 Pa.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Shut your trap!"


translate english d4_police_forced_df0a3da6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/18 Ot.ogg"
    Tikhonov "So, what were you doing in the forest during the curfew?"


translate english d4_police_forced_e7086375:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/77. Ko.ogg"
    Ant "Konstantin Vladimirovich, we were looking for Katya..."


translate english d4_police_forced_795405c1:


    "I already knew how he would react."


translate english d4_police_forced_393eb113:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/19 Pom.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Some help you are!"


translate english d4_police_forced_8b135fef:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/20 ta.ogg"
    Tikhonov "I’ll end up searching for you, too, at this rate!"


translate english d4_police_forced_1ac2a765:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/21 V.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Do you want to get into newspapers? Into their obituary section?"


translate english d4_police_forced_0819c416:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/78. Net.ogg"
    Ant "No, but…"


translate english d4_police_forced_06133775:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/22 Pe.ogg"
    Tikhonov "My, oh my, Petrov… Be honest with me. It wasn’t your idea, right?"


