translate english d4_madrom_amulet_f99dd214:


    "I had a choice. Either I run to the clearing where I'll be a sitting duck, or I'll run straight through the forest with its windfall and ravines."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_d463625f:


    "I chose the second option."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_7eebc283:


    "I jumped to the side. My leg slipped on a patch of ice. I fell into a ravine."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_ec37a520:


    "Convulsing, I struggled to turn on my back and started crawling away, expecting Romka to appear at the top at any moment."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_32383a75:


    "An inhuman roar swept across the village, drilling into my ears."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_43043837:


    "A minute passed. Then another one."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_b1b81c57:


    "I trembled, staring at the ravine's edge, into the inky brushstrokes of pines."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_0aac583d:


    "Into the approaching shadow."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_afc77b8e:


    "The boy in a wolf's mask appeared from the forest and stopped in front of me."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_04411df6:



    voice "voice/Wolf/341 Drr.ogg"
    Wolf "F-grr-iend."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_2192a2ef:


    "He unclenched his fist and a butterfly kine fell to the snow."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_616c76f1:



    voice "voice/Wolf/337 Te.ogg"
    Wolf "You a-grr-e safe. We told you. Grr-emember?"


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_2ca06f2a:


    "I stood up, barely able to believe my eyes."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_2fb35cd4:


    "The wolf boy waved his hand toward the clearing."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_2c23b345:



    voice "voice/Wolf/338 Vs.ogg"
    Wolf "It's al-grr-ight. Go."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_7f815e67:


    "I was too scared to ask questions."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_9751db70:


    "So I just walked away in silence, stumbling among the swaying trees, trying not to think about the lumps of darkness that were seeing me off, hiding in the bushes."


translate english d4_madrom_amulet_1ff02d4f:


    "At that moment, I had no idea what was actually waiting for me in the place I mistakenly called home."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_a81a6c21:


    "The steel butterfly started its slow upward movement, but then suddenly dove toward me, as if somebody fast-forwarded the tape—Romka lunged at me."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_1bc88855:


    "His face was the color of wax, and his eyes had a shine of phosphorus to them."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_7a7c84aa:


    "I felt his tackle and lowered my eyes."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_a54e5e28:


    "The butterfly was fake."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_fe8cdc8f:


    "It probably came from the prank shop, the type of toy where the blade retracts into the handle."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_f2c325d0:


    "But then I realized I was wrong, that the reason the blade was invisible to me was because it was plunged into my chest."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_192b116c:


    "It's completely inside me."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_8795b942:


    "Right between my ribs."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_0c7f5323:


    "Cold."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_53500477:


    "Sharp."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_8dcecca6:


    "And only then did pain hit me. Just like thunder that takes its sweet time to hit after the lightning,"


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_bf4f8256:


    "To my surprise, the pain wasn't exactly strong, but it felt uncomfortable, sinking, reverberating in the back of my head."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_c9b33c9c:


    "I grabbed Romka's forearm."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_7192edba:


    "He ripped the knife out of me. A dashed line of blood followed it in slow motion."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_8cedabd2:


    "The skin on the bony frame of Romka's face stretched in a grotesque grimace, his jaws wide open with threads of saliva taut between his teeth."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_1f4b58fc:


    "I wanted to ask him to stop, but words got stuck in my throat."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_2f2f3e8f:


    "The world tilted and shook."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_79c86c43:


    "I fell to my knees."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_c2186774:


    "It was suddenly difficult to breathe."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_d501fb3a:


    "As if the air in my lungs turned into viscous dough."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_ccbc8d0e:


    "Blood filled my mouth."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_65537d7f:


    "It overflowed onto the snow."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_2e470940:


    "As I couldn't hold my head straight anymore, I was forced to stare at that scarlet pool."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_8a8b44ec:


    "Then I plopped face-first into it."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_0f008cb0:


    "Blood warmed my cheeks."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_460779a6:


    "I'll just lie down for a bit, and everything will be fine."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_118a61f1:


    "It's okay, the doctors will patch me up."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_f856258c:


    "Romka grabbed me from behind and flipped me around in one violent motion."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_b2823586:


    "I saw his twisted face and his fanatical eyes."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_df62c03b:


    "Roma grabbed the butterfly knife with both hands, growled, and then brought the weapon down."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_000cb936:


    "Into my stomach."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_186822b8:


    "Pain consumed my consciousness."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_186b6dbf:


    "I couldn't move."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_ebce3b7d:


    "I couldn't even shut my eyes, even with all the hot droplets on my pupils."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_6d7de680:


    "The knife flew up."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_187351c0:


    "Then pierced some sort of bubble inside me."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_09165ca5:


    "Up."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_482c6661:


    "And down."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_09165ca5_1:


    "And up again."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_f8d2aa4b:


    "Romka screamed and stabbed."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_fc59eecd:


    "He screamed and sliced."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_378f99f6:


    "Blood splashed in my face as it streamed upward in wide scarlet stripes."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_2af9be22:


    "Dozens of little fires sparked up in my head only to die out one after another in the next moment."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_833b00c3:


    "The parts of my brain where those weird fireflies died sank into darkness."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_4bbc7fca:


    "Romka's silhouette was now blurry."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_62938336:


    "My eyes stopped following the knife."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_7c38ab6f:


    "I looked up. My vision slid across my killer's blood-soaked face, up toward the darkening sky."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_55f75919:


    "In the most fleeting of moments, I saw the life I won't be able to live."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_f0346e44:


    "A myriad of lost opportunities."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_9e2db832:


    "As the sole spectator in this empty movie theater, I stared at the screen."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_ea9fc573:


    "I saw Olya growing up without me."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_bf6db4be:


    "I saw her future kids that I will never hold in my arms."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_95227c14:


    "My aging parents, living in the house at the edge of the forest."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_00b5f09a:


    "I saw the bright galleries and exhibition halls, the walls of which will never be adorned by my paintings."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_9cb43253:


    "The pavements of cities I will never visit."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_af3f9321:


    "The twenty-first century that I will not welcome."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_e677661f:


    "And a universe of people and things that were now irretrievably lost for me."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_0d917b00:


    "I saw a blinding, scorching light. I had no idea if it was in the sky, or under my lowering eyelids."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_87018947:


    "The knife just kept on stabbing, but the pain was gone."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_df81be10:


    "My body no longer mattered."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_aad70355:


    "The movie was over."


translate english d4_madrom_no_amulet_52700098:


    "I disappeared into the bottomless void."


translate english d4_home_devend_fce5f2d1:


    "The house was a dark stain on the white snowy blanket."


translate english d4_home_devend_9f3ead3f:


    "The front door was open and swayed slightly in the wind."


translate english d4_home_devend_02c65b2c:


    "It felt like my skin was getting covered in rime."


translate english d4_home_devend_d261f3b2:


    "I clenched my fists."


translate english d4_home_devend_575521e9:


    "Sharp edges of the photo depicting Katya’s remains dug into my palm."


translate english d4_home_devend_4e315b85:


    "Darkness oozed into the hallway, and snowflakes floated inside along with it, landing softly on the rug."


translate english d4_home_devend_23dba9c5:


    "Like a pack of vultures that sensed their food."


translate english d4_home_devend_4b0be9a7:


    "I imagined three meat grinders in different parts of the house and three members of my family getting ground by their blades."


translate english d4_home_devend_1ecdc1bb:


    "I stepped into the doorway with the utmost caution."


translate english d4_home_devend_87c5d423:


    "For a moment, I thought I heard someone talking in the kitchen, but it turned out to be a radio broadcast."


translate english d4_home_devend_6a300ca5:


    Radio "...the previously mentioned cyclone is getting even close to the region. The official forecast for tomorrow suggests gusts of wind reaching up to 70 kilometers per hour..."


translate english d4_home_devend_4a893069:


    Radio "EMERCOM of Russia has called on citizens to exercise extreme caution. The roads are closed off, the cold air streams coming from the Arctic are bringing massive blizzards..."


translate english d4_home_devend_c84cb48a:


    "I heard voices coming from the upper floor, too."


translate english d4_home_devend_3db7cbd2:


    "For the first time in my life, sounds of a quarrel calmed me down."


translate english d4_home_devend_7a473da3:


    "The staircase let out a long squeak."


translate english d4_home_devend_42d94d1b:


    "I took one step, yet my heart managed to beat six or seven times in the meantime."


translate english d4_home_devend_33efb15d:


    "The door to my parent's bedroom was ajar."


translate english d4_home_devend_c8a9b4bb:


    "A shadow play unfolded inside a light spot. Black silhouettes were performing a dance of hatred."


translate english d4_home_devend_71bd040c:


    "Mom hissed at Dad, her wrists flying toward the ceiling, and he towered over her, his hands crossed on his huge chest."


translate english d4_home_devend_a71dc98a:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/125 Me.ogg"
    Mam "We're all in danger. And it's your fault!"


translate english d4_home_devend_d1c5bb75:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/126 E.ogg"
    Mam "And stop lying! You saw him in the village!"


translate english d4_home_devend_fcd4b10f:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/127 On.ogg"
    Mam "He found out where we live!"


translate english d4_home_devend_2654c723:



    voice "voice/father/day4/74 Eto.ogg"
    Pap "It wasn't him."


translate english d4_home_devend_7339df07:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/128 Ya.ogg"
    Mam "I've read about the things your buddies are capable of in the newspapers."


translate english d4_home_devend_b869dfdc:


    "I stuffed the photo inside my pocket and walked toward my bedroom."


translate english d4_home_devend_f5e59a6f:


    "I ran toward my bedroom."


translate english d4_home_devend_995a6f97:


    "My parents were in the middle of another quarrel where they showered each other with mutual accusations."


translate english d4_home_devend_a7a24b0b:


    "My parents were in the middle of another quarrel where they showered each other with mutual accusations."


translate english d4_home_devend_27b57de3:


    "Dad let out a low, beast-like roar."


translate english d4_home_devend_e514b770:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/01 P.ogg"
    Oly "Make them stop."


translate english d4_home_devend_aafa097a:


    "Olya stood in the corridor, pressing her little palms against her ears."


translate english d4_home_devend_bb17906b:


    "I chased away the illusion where my sister was getting devoured by the blades of a meat grinder."


translate english d4_home_devend_ab56e0f4:


    "I chased away the illusion where my sister was getting stabbed to death by Romka for my sins."


translate english d4_home_devend_526f22af:


    "Her face, swollen from crying, made my skin freeze."


translate english d4_home_devend_32928d7e:


    "And it almost managed to push Katya’s bloody image out of my mind."


translate english d4_home_devend_2ae3d40f:


    "And almost managed to push the image of old Khariton smirking and Pratyifan jumping on all fours out of my mind."


translate english d4_home_devend_2ffe2945:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/168. Chto.ogg"
    Ant "What happened?"


translate english d4_home_devend_24d8a805:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/02 O.ogg"
    Oly "They're going to divorce."


translate english d4_home_devend_a338feb1:


    "I hugged my sister and held her tight."


translate english d4_home_devend_d3c89123:


    "My tongue refused to listen to my commands, to look for excuses."


translate english d4_home_devend_8cb648bb:


    "It felt like the screams were coming from every direction. Right and left, up and down. Splitting my head apart."


translate english d4_home_devend_1a68a870:


    "Swear words rained down on us so we covered our heads with our hands, like refugees running from a bombing."


translate english d4_home_devend_5c22eb8e:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/03 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "I want to escape!"


translate english d4_home_devend_8da83c29:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/169. V.ogg"
    Ant "To your room?"


translate english d4_home_devend_9fca7395:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/04 Ne.ogg"
    Oly "No! Far away!"


translate english d4_home_devend_4efba16f:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/05 O.ogg"
    Oly "Lead me to Neverland! You promised!"


translate english d4_home_devend_88ec629f:


    "I carefully unglued Olya's hands from her ears and led her away from the room with our parents, which was vibrating with malice."


translate english d4_home_devend_bb44ce1f:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/129 Ez.ogg"
    Mam "Your fault!"


translate english d4_home_devend_b67bf11f:



    voice "voice/father/day4/79 Ra.ogg"
    Pap "For whom..."


translate english d4_home_devend_82fece35:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/130 To.ogg"
    Mam "Your own, and only your own!"


translate english d4_home_devend_38717d0b:



    voice "voice/father/day4/80 Ni.ogg"
    Pap "I would never...!"


translate english d4_home_devend_2732c8d6:


    "In moments like these, I despised them more than they despised each other."


translate english d4_home_devend_2dc351ab:


    "I bolted down the door to my room and leaned against it. My knees gave way."


translate english d4_home_devend_eea08eb0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/170. Pos.ogg"
    Ant "Look, Olya. I also hate it here."


translate english d4_home_devend_ee4aff83:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/06 Ti.ogg"
    Oly "At least you can go to school!"


translate english d4_home_devend_47394893:


    "I let out a sad laugh."


translate english d4_home_devend_4313de47:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/171. Eta.ogg"
    Ant "That school is one big nightmare! Everybody hates me!"


translate english d4_home_devend_4ba292b1:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/173. To.ogg"
    Ant "There's only this one girl, who isn't making fun of me. She takes pity on me, instead, like I'm a beaten dog."


translate english d4_home_devend_e6c76c16:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/07Tine.ogg"
    Oly "You're not a dog! You..."


translate english d4_home_devend_f44df905:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/174. Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I don't know who I am anymore."


translate english d4_home_devend_4bf03a4a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/175.No.ogg"
    Ant "But the outside world is clearly no better than our home."


translate english d4_home_devend_e87b4a64:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/08 Gd.ogg"
    Oly "Do you know a better place? Let's go there! We'll fly or swim!"


translate english d4_home_devend_b2b40cf0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/173. Es.ogg"
    Ant "If only we could do that... I would've sacrificed everything to escape and take you with me."


translate english d4_home_devend_cf4ad8f0:


    "Olya's upper lip trembled."


translate english d4_home_devend_2e8d1e5a:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/09K.ogg"
    Oly "Swear?"


translate english d4_home_devend_9f2c25fd:


    "I put on a bitter smile."


translate english d4_home_devend_049fb58f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/174. Chto.ogg"
    Ant "On my own life!"


translate english d4_home_devend_7913295c:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/10 Po.ogg"
    Oly "Why were you out for so long?"


translate english d4_home_devend_5eefda11:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/176. ya.ogg"
    Ant "I went to visit some… weird people."


translate english d4_home_devend_81ba83d6:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/12 oni.ogg"
    Oly "Are they also getting divorced?"


translate english d4_home_devend_9b3b85df:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/175.  Y.ogg"
    Ant "I tried to help a girl."


translate english d4_home_devend_f5818d1d:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/11 Т.ogg"
    Oly "Did you help her?"


translate english d4_home_devend_e693c21f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/177. Ne.ogg"
    Ant "I don’t think so."


translate english d4_home_devend_2338354b:


    "I stood in front of the table, carefully opened one of its drawers and threw the photo of Katya's bloody braid inside."


translate english d4_home_devend_635b3606:


    "Olya tried to take a look behind my back, but I slammed the drawer shut."


translate english d4_beasts_4550171d:


    "And at the same time, something hit the window's ledge on the outside."


translate english d4_beasts_7c780c94:


    "Something hit the window's ledge on the outside."


translate english d4_beasts_c3ac3642:


    "Olya shuddered and shifted her gaze toward it."


translate english d4_beasts_7a101568:


    "Bam! Another snowball smacked into the window’s frame."


translate english d4_beasts_5d024f0c:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/14 Ti.ogg"
    Oly "Were you expecting someone?"


translate english d4_beasts_7fe9a557:


    "I didn’t reply."


translate english d4_beasts_8a307fc4:


    "Instead, I let go of her wrist. Olya wept in fear."


translate english d4_beasts_68da4db8:


    "I crossed the room, wincing from every shout coming from my parents. I could hear plates getting smashed now, they must have moved their argument to the kitchen."


translate english d4_beasts_72054b3a:


    "I flung the curtains and the window open."


translate english d4_beasts_6e481126:


    "Hooty, Teddy, Wolfy, and most importantly, the charming Alisa stood outside, waving at us."


translate english d4_beasts_9ba68ee9:


    "Olya gasped in surprise when she saw the owl girl."


translate english d4_beasts_5ab8fd51:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/16 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "See, I told you."


translate english d4_beasts_15db6a80:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/178. Da.ogg"
    Ant "Yeah, I know. I always believed you."


translate english d4_beasts_b52b0021:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/17 K.ogg"
    Oly "Who are they?"


translate english d4_beasts_438664f7:


    "Her fearful voice also had some curiosity mixed in."


translate english d4_beasts_710e860f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/05Chob.ogg"
    Alis "Only the most boring children sit at home in weather like this!"


translate english d4_beasts_4549cb9c:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/06 U.ogg"
    Owl "We still have so many games to play, hoot!"


translate english d4_beasts_0d2e6d3d:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/22 Dav.ogg"
    Bear "But let’s not play all of them, my paw hurts."


translate english d4_beasts_ed60f675:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/23 Po.ogg"
    Bear "We play a little, then rest."


translate english d4_beasts_cc4a3f79:



    voice "voice/Wolf/317 Dr.ogg"
    Wolf "F-grr-iends!"


translate english d4_beasts_ec4ca3d6:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/05Vihod.ogg"
    Animals "Come on, come out to play and dance!"


translate english d4_beasts_773288f4:


    "My heart started beating faster as soon as I saw Alisa, and my inner voice practically screamed: {i}\"She’s here! She’s finally here!\"{i}"


translate english d4_beasts_0b1b6abd:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/18 A.ogg"
    Oly "Do they know the way to Neverland?"


translate english d4_beasts_e64091b2:


    "I entertained that possibility, looking at the animal kids."


translate english d4_beasts_c1f62110:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/179. Mo.ogg"
    Ant "Maybe...? Let’s go find out!"


translate english d4_beasts_1fa7fb3c:


    "The silhouettes of my forest friends promised to free us from sadness, anger, and nightly horrors."


translate english d4_beasts_8fac9ee2:


    "I made sure that Olya wore warm clothes."


translate english d4_beasts_fcaa9b90:


    "Mom barked at Dad like a wild beast from that show with {u}Nikolai Drozdov{/u}."


translate english d4_beasts_758afeb5:


    "We sneaked past the rumbling kitchen and into the snowfall outside."


translate english d4_beasts_89508a77:


    "Alisa ran up to me and hugged me tight, poking her cold nose into my neck."


translate english d4_beasts_375b0991:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/55 Kak.ogg"
    Alis "You took soooo long!"


translate english d4_beasts_cbb7c71a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/56 Poka.ogg"
    Alis "We almost got old waiting for you shut-ins."


translate english d4_beasts_3aa41bd2:


    "She pressed her body into me even harder."


translate english d4_beasts_8e13c15e:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/25 Okaz.ogg"
    Bear "Turns out, waiting is so tiring."


translate english d4_beasts_01f81188:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/26 Fuh.ogg"
    Bear "Phew! Give me a minute to catch my breath."


translate english d4_beasts_8b1dc4f1:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/06 Od.ogg"
    Owl "I was preparing to leave for a long time once, hoot-hoot, and when I was done, I forgot where I was supposed to go."


translate english d4_beasts_362ff3c7:


    "Olya looked at the owl with suspicion."


translate english d4_beasts_bc8a8f8c:


    "But she still giggled when the bird did a backflip and landed perfectly on her feet, without staggering."


translate english d4_beasts_803dc86e:


    "All the other animals, as if on cue, stopped fooling around and stared at Olya in amazement."


translate english d4_beasts_239ffaec:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/04 Eto.ogg"
    Owl "That’s the girl who didn’t want to become friends!"


translate english d4_beasts_6873312f:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/20 M.ogg"
    Oly "My name is Olya."


translate english d4_beasts_aaa07375:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/21 R.ogg"
    Oly "I... I was afraid of you... before."


translate english d4_beasts_69b50d39:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/57 Teb.ogg"
    Alis "Were you afraid of our Hooty?"


translate english d4_beasts_71254f44:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/27 Moz.ogg"
    Bear "Maybe she has owl-phobia?"


translate english d4_beasts_a6109cce:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/05 A.ogg"
    Owl "Can you cure that?"


translate english d4_beasts_ad669580:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/58 Glavn.ogg"
    Alis "It doesn’t matter as long as she’s not afraid of having fun."


translate english d4_beasts_06166f74:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/59 Inach.ogg"
    Alis "Or she might get scared to death with us. Ahahaha!"


translate english d4_beasts_cd49beaa:


    "I was stunned at the realization that my lips were slowly forming a smile."


translate english d4_beasts_46eac13e:


    "And that’s after everything I saw while at Polina’s house!"


translate english d4_beasts_ae6290b7:


    "And that’s after everything I saw in the Garage!"


translate english d4_beasts_62bf107d:


    "Every time I met Alisa, it felt like I crossed a river, and the sound of flowing water suppressed all of my negative thoughts."


translate english d4_beasts_3a30babc:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/22 Ka.ogg"
    Oly "Your costumes are so pretty!"


translate english d4_beasts_53a09897:


    "The fox girl let go of me and squatted beside Olya."


translate english d4_beasts_daf56785:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/60 Oo.ogg"
    Alis "My, what a cutie!"


translate english d4_beasts_5eefb190:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/61 Anto.ogg"
    Alis "Why did you hide such a cute creature from us before?"


translate english d4_beasts_d66dc5ae:


    "I glanced at the house, worried that our parents might’ve seen us and were about to ruin our fun like they always do."


translate english d4_beasts_736d69df:


    "Then hugged my sister and replied."


translate english d4_beasts_8daf294a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/180.Da.ogg"
    Ant "Let’s get further away from here."


translate english d4_beasts_605ec087:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/62 Zapr.ogg"
    Alis "Sure thing!"


translate english d4_beasts_e8e78cf8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/63 Ol.ogg"
    Alis "Hey, Olya, do you know how to find {u}Grandpa Frost{/u} in our forest?"


translate english d4_beasts_18b2a729:


    "My little sister’s eyes widened."


translate english d4_beasts_892d6ca4:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/23 K.ogg"
    Oly "How?"


translate english d4_beasts_492495ad:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/64 Nu.ogg"
    Alis "You need to follow the sweet trail."


translate english d4_beasts_2be8123e:


    "Alisa bent down and took a candy out of the snow."


translate english d4_beasts_9a8b951e:


    "Olya raised her hands in amazement."


translate english d4_beasts_0b0b8933:


    "She gave me an inquiring look. I nodded."


translate english d4_beasts_c251c651:


    "My sister munched on the candy."


translate english d4_beasts_d1ea2144:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/10 Un.ogg"
    Owl "Wait, do we, hoot-hoot, have Grandpa Frost in our forest?"


translate english d4_beasts_41c48d8b:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/11 Po.ogg"
    Owl "Why, hoot-hoot, didn’t you tell me?"


translate english d4_beasts_2928f633:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/65 ya.ogg"
    Alis "I did. This afternoon."


translate english d4_beasts_6fe04525:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/23 No.ogg"
    Owl "But I sleep during the day."


translate english d4_beasts_f6ae455f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/66 Aga.ogg"
    Alis "Right. I told you while you were sleeping."


translate english d4_beasts_f6789ae1:


    "I remembered Romka while listening to their childish conversation."


translate english d4_beasts_9a10adf9:


    "How he screamed at the top of his lungs while chasing me, mere minutes before Wolfy appeared."


translate english d4_beasts_38a49572:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/181. Chto.ogg"
    Ant "What happened to Romka?"


translate english d4_beasts_4a996991:



    voice "voice/Wolf/319 Pov.ogg"
    Wolf "He’s al-grr-ight, t-grrr-ust me!"


translate english d4_beasts_a599268c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/67 Ziv.ogg"
    Alis "Your Romka is safe and sound."


translate english d4_beasts_e2c73089:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/68 Tol.ogg"
    Alis "But a bad boy like him is unlikely to get a present from Grandpa Frost."


translate english d4_beasts_1ec6dbdc:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/69 mak.ogg"
    Alis "He’ll get a handful of coal at best."


translate english d4_beasts_cc957c9a:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/48Nu.ogg"
    Bear "Or his ass whooped."


translate english d4_beasts_f89250af:


    "Teddy shook his bandaged paw in a comically threatening manner and the animal kids all burst out laughing in unison."


translate english d4_beasts_ff855682:


    "The anxiousness I felt a moment ago now felt fleeting, distant."


translate english d4_beasts_c40d2344:


    "Alisa dashed away, wiggling her red tail like a torch's flame."


translate english d4_beasts_ba4fdb03:


    "Olya went after her without thinking and laughed after taking another candy out of a snow pile."


translate english d4_beasts_8185603f:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/30 Vi.ogg"
    Bear "You’re so lively it makes me sick to the stomach."


translate english d4_beasts_e32bd85e:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/26 Ati.ogg"
    Oly "And you stop being so passive."


translate english d4_beasts_ed66e184:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/26 Lu.ogg"
    Oly "Run with us to Grandpa Frost, while there are still presents left."


translate english d4_beasts_dffeea20:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/31 Ska.ogg"
    Bear "No way!"


translate english d4_beasts_4752a6a7:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/32 Skoree.ogg"
    Bear "I won’t believe the fox’s tales unless ten pounds of sweets drop on my head right now."


translate english d4_beasts_994b4462:


    "When the aforementioned sweets started raining down on the bear’s head I couldn’t stop myself from laughing at him ouch-ing and bobbing his head up and down."


translate english d4_beasts_ad5e3f00:


    "Tasty treats glistened in the snow. Teddy sneezed and pulled a \"Little Bear In the North\" candy out of his ear."


translate english d4_beasts_117ca0d7:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/34 Yab.ogg"
    Bear "I’d take an hour-long nap and then count all these chocolates."


translate english d4_beasts_fd14cdf3:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/35Umen.ogg"
    Bear "I suspect there are no more than three pounds here."


translate english d4_beasts_2ad0cc1f:


    "Alisa shouted at us from the other side of the forest."


translate english d4_beasts_3b2eb4e0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/70 Ne.ogg"
    Alis "Maybe in another life!"


translate english d4_beasts_f5baba14:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/71 Dav.ogg"
    Alis "Hurry up, Grandpa Frost is already tired of waiting for you in his castle!"


translate english d4_beasts_d0467c37:


    "I shrugged and ran. Running loosened the grip of fear I felt all this time."


translate english d4_beasts_6a214df4:


    "Something round whizzed past my temple. I decided it was a snowball, but then Olya proclaimed:"


translate english d4_beasts_991ff062:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/29Z.ogg"
    Oly "{u}Zefir{/u}!"


translate english d4_beasts_abae0784:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/182. Ne.ogg"
    Ant "Don’t pick it up, it’s dirty."


translate english d4_beasts_c97140b0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/72 Ti.ogg"
    Alis "Huh? Do you believe in microbes?"


translate english d4_beasts_ee81f823:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/184.  A.ogg"
    Ant "And you don’t?"


translate english d4_beasts_b21e5ca2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/73 Ra.ogg"
    Alis "I used to."


translate english d4_beasts_24369c6e:


    "Graceful rows of colossal pines greeted us with their rustling paws."


translate english d4_beasts_1971fd45:


    "Snow drifted upward, into the endless black sky, just like last time."


translate english d4_beasts_ff2050de:


    "Snow piles lighted up like melted silver."


translate english d4_beasts_00b0fe4e:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/30 Ka.ogg"
    Oly "So pretty! And I thought the forest was scary."


translate english d4_beasts_e1135d56:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/01Nas.ogg"
    Alis "Parents told us scary stories of the forest, owl, and snow..."


translate english d4_beasts_5dab2bff:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/02Nu.ogg"
    Alis "But we weren't one bit worried, playing with her when Moon glows."


translate english d4_beasts_6c00ba40:


    "I did my best to keep track of Olya’s movement, but it was a difficult task: my sister would jump inside bushes, picking up more candy, only to then get back to the trail, laughing."


translate english d4_beasts_c822571e:


    "Hooty flew over our heads, landed on a branch, and started hooting and shaking her head."


translate english d4_beasts_fb23c5ff:


    "Wolfy dug into the snow with his face, dragged out a pile of bubble gum, and swallowed it without taking off the wrapping."


translate english d4_beasts_c9b0f154:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/32 U.ogg"
    Oly "Your tummy will hurt!"


translate english d4_beasts_6610ed3d:


    "The wolf got scared and spat out the gumball."


translate english d4_beasts_5519c83d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/75 Vra.ogg"
    Alis "Lies, lies, lies, nasty flies!"


translate english d4_beasts_e740c1ae:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/76 Net.ogg"
    Alis "Tummy aches don’t exist."


translate english d4_beasts_e475c2b4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/76 Vs.ogg"
    Alis "All that nonsense only happens to grown-ups."


translate english d4_beasts_fbd85b32:


    "Alisa stopped in her tracks, and moved a canopy of intertwined branches to the side in a pompous manner, like you would open the curtains in theater."


translate english d4_palace_dev_1602a5aa:


    "Behind that obstacle lay a clearing. There stood an ice castle, glistening with silver."


translate english d4_palace_dev_b6dfd695:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/33 O.ogg"
    Oly "Is this real?"


translate english d4_palace_dev_6994304a:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/37 Ush.ogg"
    Bear "Should I pinch you?"


translate english d4_palace_dev_e73085e0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/185. Ne.ogg"
    Ant "There's no need to pinch her."


translate english d4_palace_dev_86e727a2:


    "We stared at the sparkling miracle: its towers and walls were made out of snow and icy marble."


translate english d4_palace_dev_15b3e364:


    "I heard a calming sound of ringing little bells. There was also the smell of chocolate and burnt sugar in the air."


translate english d4_palace_dev_48e4a5d3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/78 Mi.ogg"
    Alis "Welcome to our humble abode! Come on in!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_8db649a8:


    "She didn’t have to invite us twice. We entered the castle, spinning around and squinting from the blinding sparkles."


translate english d4_palace_dev_bf0e276b:


    "Grandpa Frost sat atop a shiny throne."


translate english d4_palace_dev_77bcdeff:


    "Puffy pom-poms swung atop the two peaks of his hat. A snow-white beard covered his kind smile."


translate english d4_palace_dev_6cde7907:


    "He looked just like I imagined him back in the day when I still believed in Mom’s fairy tales: tall, strong, and hairy, radiating frost and warmth at the same time."


translate english d4_palace_dev_8e451b1f:


    "And his voice, low and syrupy, enveloped me like the smoke of a festive bonfire."


translate english d4_palace_dev_84f7f9a7:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/68.A.ogg"
    Frost "Anton and Olga!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_3af8592c:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/OH.ogg"
    Frost "You probably got tired while getting here, my dear children!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_2ebaafc3:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/34 Cho.ogg"
    Oly "Oh no, Grandpa, we got here really fast."


translate english d4_palace_dev_c1fffc83:


    "My sister spoke with the castle's master like she never spoke with adults—in a lively, carefree manner—as if they were the same age."


translate english d4_palace_dev_5aac4ce4:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/69.Z.ogg"
    Frost "Of course, I know all about it!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_cd45da57:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/70.Mne.ogg"
    Frost "I have a lot of friends, they tell me everything..."


translate english d4_palace_dev_8cd167df:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/71.Kto.ogg"
    Frost "If you’re diligent all year, I will bring you gifts, my dear."


translate english d4_palace_dev_d8665549:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/73.A.ogg"
    Frost "If you’re lazy and upset, please, forgive this kind old man."


translate english d4_palace_dev_353d04b1:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/75.Len.ogg"
    Frost "Candy won't encounter, lazybones and downers."


translate english d4_palace_dev_e012ce6c:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/35 A.ogg"
    Oly "I’m not lazy!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_83cf0c0c:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/76.Eo.ogg"
    Frost "This too, I know."


translate english d4_palace_dev_fc254435:


    "He gave us a long, evaluating look."


translate english d4_palace_dev_1eaf3347:


    "His real face was hidden under the Grandpa Frost mask."


translate english d4_palace_dev_ab69f723:


    "I was just standing there, unblinking, my gaze glued to the old man."


translate english d4_palace_dev_a4968ca0:


    "I could accept children living in the forest and fantastical jumps toward the Moon, but seeing Grandpa Frost in his frozen castle left me completely speechless."


translate english d4_palace_dev_38fdbdf6:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/77.Est.ogg"
    Frost "I have something special for you two."


translate english d4_palace_dev_a7d83461:


    "A sack appeared in his giant hand. My nostrils got attacked by the aroma of cocoa, {u}halva{/u}, and tangerines."


translate english d4_palace_dev_b44c206b:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/186. Spa.ogg"
    Ant "Thank you, but we’ve already eaten some candy."


translate english d4_palace_dev_1667d9cf:


    "Grandpa Frost pierced me with his eyes."


translate english d4_palace_dev_d2c4ce21:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/78.Raz.ogg"
    Frost "Hohoho! You call that candy? That was nothing."


translate english d4_palace_dev_5cd5b1c3:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/79.Vot.ogg"
    Frost "My candy is special, straight from Neverland. Hohoho!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_5a59b04a:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/36 Ez.ogg"
    Oly "From Neverland?!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_32544e26:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/80.Sra.ogg"
    Frost "I’d give them to you right away, you clearly deserve them."


translate english d4_palace_dev_22c37a39:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/81.No.ogg"
    Frost "But rules are rules."


translate english d4_palace_dev_551e0fcd:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/82.Nad.ogg"
    Frost "You need to solve three of Grandpa’s riddles. Want to try?"


translate english d4_palace_dev_b932e836:


    "I tried splitting my parched lips apart, but Olya was the first to reply."


translate english d4_palace_dev_972c4901:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/37 Da.ogg"
    Oly "Yeah!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_d1ff0ad1:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/83.To.ogg"
    Frost "Here comes the first one..."


translate english d4_palace_dev_8132fbc4:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/84.Vn.ogg"
    Frost "It’s a home for cars and all sorts of tires."


translate english d4_palace_dev_7739df92:


    "I looked around, at the masked children."


translate english d4_palace_dev_b436b27e:


    "They stood without moving in the corners, but their shadows danced on the walls."


translate english d4_palace_dev_3494720e:


    "I heard a low hum, and in my confusion, I thought it was the sound of their rumbling stomachs."


translate english d4_palace_dev_79b38e74:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/38 G.ogg"
    Oly "A garage!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_0d2f076b:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/85.Ver.ogg"
    Frost "Correct!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_0b9a72e7:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/85.Tep.ogg"
    Frost "Now, on to the second one. You try to solve it, too, Anton."


translate english d4_palace_dev_177e22ac:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/85.Ves.ogg"
    Frost "All day long, to the shadows they belong, They rattle the plates and hiss at their mates."


translate english d4_palace_dev_1212c1f7:


    "My eyebrows shot up in confusion."


translate english d4_palace_dev_19c6d4f3:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/187. Ma.ogg"
    Ant "Moms?"


translate english d4_palace_dev_07a3503c:


    "Olya raised her hand."


translate english d4_palace_dev_5b9624b3:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/39M.ogg"
    Oly "Can I?! Can I?!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_9bf2a448:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/40 Eto.ogg"
    Oly "It’s a kitty!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_589e2b51:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/87.Verno.ogg"
    Frost "Correct, hohoho! Here’s the last one… Solve it and the gifts are yours."


translate english d4_palace_dev_4da636f1:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/88.Тol.ogg"
    Frost "Oh, but what a stroke of bad luck, my dear children..."


translate english d4_palace_dev_7f3253fe:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/89.Zapa.ogg"
    Frost "I completely forgot what that riddle was about."


translate english d4_palace_dev_7c6c2e2f:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/90.Moz.ogg"
    Frost "Maybe our little animal friends can help us?"


translate english d4_palace_dev_bd2c187b:


    "Children in costumes surrounded us, laughing and stomping, only to start spinning in a crazed roundelay, that somewhat reminded me of the dance under my window on that fateful night."


translate english d4_palace_dev_61c24f43:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/04Ded.ogg"
    Animals "Grandpa Frost sits on his throne, at the kids he’s smiling back."


translate english d4_palace_dev_60612709:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/04Netomy.ogg"
    Animals "Please don’t make them wait too long, come and open your old..."


translate english d4_palace_dev_b5c9c21d:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/41 M.ogg"
    Oly "Sack!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_1d060bb8:


    "Grandpa Frost burst out laughing, satisfied."


translate english d4_palace_dev_886e66f9:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/91.Ub.ogg"
    Frost "Okay, you proved yourself to this old man! Here you go!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_4635e5d8:


    "He scattered a mountain of sweets from his scarlet sack, some of which I had never even seen in commercials before."


translate english d4_palace_dev_d309a71f:


    "Bubble gum of all shapes and colors with tasty aromas and inserts sticking out."


translate english d4_palace_dev_6b361560:


    "Lollipops the size of a fist and tangerines the size of Olya’s head."


translate english d4_palace_dev_7665e7fb:


    "And also \"Snickers\", \"Mars\", \"Bounty\" bars, and \"Kinder Surprise\" eggs, that we haven’t eaten for so long already."


translate english d4_palace_dev_b262b4ea:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/42 Oi.ogg"
    Oly "Wow, thank you!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_94780613:


    "I wiped away the tears of joy with my sleeve when my inner voice persuaded me to get rid of all doubts."


translate english d4_palace_dev_3d92ef02:


    "This is exactly what I wanted for my sister and myself."


translate english d4_palace_dev_4f4bd7eb:


    "The true Neverland... Without bullying and taboos."


translate english d4_palace_dev_76ef1714:


    "We’re finally going to be happy."


translate english d4_palace_dev_526a9959:


    "Grandpa Frost straightened up as he left his throne, and threw his hands in the air over the treats."


translate english d4_palace_dev_100e3433:


    "Animals that stood to his sides also raised their paws."


translate english d4_palace_dev_e69f1563:


    "Their eyes sparkled brighter than precious gems. The wolf’s maw was wet with saliva."


translate english d4_palace_dev_13f18634:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/92.Da.ogg"
    Frost "Feast, my children!"


translate english d4_palace_dev_469db1f3:


    "Animal kids rushed to devour candy one by one, pushing each other and growling. Their faces were smeared with something dark."


translate english d4_palace_dev_fc8c3b8f:


    "Olya grabbed the closest candy and tore off the wrapper."


translate english d4_palace_dev_9f556e45:


    "When I saw that, I felt a pendulum swing inside me."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_16cd2758:


    "I gripped Olya’s wrist so hard that she squeaked, either from pain or from surprise."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_5d7973be:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/188. Ne.ogg"
    Ant "Don’t."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_0861aedf:


    "Cautious whispers spread through the room. Ears twitched on the masks."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_f7aa3fcd:


    "Shadows slid from one place to another."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_23f49535:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/13 Chto.ogg"
    Owl "What’s wrong? Did something happen?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_42c78e1d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/80 Niche.ogg"
    Alis "It’s fine!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_9f3050f7:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/81 Prosto.ogg"
    Alis "It’s just Tosha believes in non-existing diabetes."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_5475bff9:



    voice "voice/Wolf/325 Ro.ogg"
    Wolf "Pa-grrr-ents lie!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_e0e46c4e:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/41Raz.ogg"
    Bear "Wake me up when he stops fooling around."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_09ffec4a:


    "Grandpa Frost leaned into me."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_81707acc:


    "He smelled of caramel and just a tiny bit of dampness."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_1fdc838e:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/93.Dav.ogg"
    Frost "Let’s not spoil this wonderful occasion, my friends!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_c88a31f2:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/94.Se.ogg"
    Frost "Everybody should be having fun today! Eat and dance!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_124e4976:


    "Olya tried to pull her hand away, but I kept it in my clutches."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_6435fb94:


    "I looked at the sweets, then at the tall old man, and tried to focus on a barely discernible stench coming from him."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_c271353c:


    "The stench of rot and decay, masked with a sugary aroma. The foul smell of a beast."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_6fce4674:


    "It felt like I was finally able to shrug off some strong delusion. Fear, exhaustion, and coldness returned to me."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_dec212e6:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/189. Spa.ogg"
    Ant "Thank you, but we’re not hungry."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_c867455f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/190Emi.ogg"
    Ant "And, um…. I think we’ll be going. Mom and Dad are probably worried sick already."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_00fe4461:


    "I dragged my sister toward the exit, but Alisa stood in our path."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_6e44fe19:


    "She had a china platter in her hands."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_9360c70a:


    "For a brief moment, I imagined maggots crawling inside it, but as soon as my eyes darted toward the offering, I saw gummy worms instead of a vomit-inducing writhing ball of living ones."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_52add1bd:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/82 Pro.ogg"
    Alis "Anton, please. We’re friends, right? "


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_64a7ec8f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/83 Me.ogg"
    Alis "We’re even more than friends."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_48001039:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/84 Vs.ogg"
    Alis "Remember my promise?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_1168c6fe:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/85 Ni.ogg"
    Alis "Nobody will hurt you as long as I’m here."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_ec8ea7b9:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/86 Nite.ogg"
    Alis "Neither you nor Olya."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_90bf5e82:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/87 Tak.ogg"
    Alis "So please, eat at least one."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_553cb373:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/88  S.ogg"
    Alis "Pretty please?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_b0fca83a:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/44 An.ogg"
    Oly "Let me go, Anton! Let me go!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_cc9a7989:


    voice "voice/olya/4day/45 T.ogg"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_af5a51b1:


    Oly "You're just like Mom now, forbidding me from doing anything!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_d5cf7410:


    "Olya convulsed hysterically, trying to free herself from my clutches."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_2a17ef02:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/190Eto.ogg"
    Ant "This is wrong..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_509ddf27:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/191 V.ogg"
    Ant "Everything is wrong about this place."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_e4227c9e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/89 Vot.ogg"
    Alis "Is that so?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_b6c71aa2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/90 At.ogg"
    Alis "Have you considered that maybe the only thing that is wrong here is your perception?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_38874dbe:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/91 Kak.ogg"
    Alis "Ever thought what those pills that you gulp down every day do to you, huh?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_df4bed80:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/92 Oni.ogg"
    Alis "They twist reality, they tangle your thoughts, they lead you away from the snowy trail."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_42b2c7c1:


    "I looked at Alisa with suspicion, searching for a comeback..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_69587d6b:


    "...but I couldn’t find one."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_c744cd2e:


    "I remembered Vova’s bloody mitten."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_1d0a2b44:


    "But that was just an illusion."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_46df7aeb:


    "I remembered Semyon’s severed finger inside a small plastic bag."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_1d0a2b44_1:


    "But that was just an illusion."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_86ddc5fa:


    "I remembered Vova’s bloody mitten and Semyon’s severed finger inside a small plastic bag."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_9da3bb8c:


    "All of that was just an illusion."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_17af32f0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/191. Kto.ogg"
    Ant "W-who are you?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_daf5eedc:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/96.Ana.ogg"
    Frost "And who do we look like to you?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_e09cf1ab:


    "Like nightmares that ravage my sick mind."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_af4905bc:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/97.Sname.ogg"
    Frost "With us, nobody will ever punish you, nobody will lock you up in your room or abandon you."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_a94d9441:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/98.Ot.ogg"
    Frost "From this moment on, nobody will be able to force something you don’t want upon you."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_2e241738:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/otkuda.ogg"
    Ant "How do you know what we don’t want?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_6104c4c6:


    "The old man rubbed Wolfy, who was munching loudly, behind the ear."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_a44fea29:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/99.Ya.ogg"
    Frost "Oh, I do know."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_3dfd0733:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/100.Mne.ogg"
    Frost "Winds and shadows whisper to me, as do cold stars and endless skies."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_a35ce320:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/102.On.ogg"
    Frost "They tell me that children don’t want to grow up."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_146e2dd3:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/103.Pre.ogg"
    Frost "They don’t want to turn into those who live by taboos, threats, and punishments."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_a3566ee7:


    "His voice grew louder and louder with every word."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_f741df14:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/104.Oz.ogg"
    Frost "Those who live, waiting to grow old and die."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_35ba5222:


    voice "voice/kozel/4day/105.De.ogg"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_6e433b24:


    Frost "But children live by their dreams."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_55cacc8a:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/106.O.ogg"
    Frost "Oh, I know full well how children dream of a happy and carefree life."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_1ede2e4b:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/107.Toi.ogg"
    Frost "The life of wild freedom and miracles."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_a617c634:


    "His voice rang like thunder, it made all hair on my head stand on end."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_6112722c:


    voice "voice/kozel/4day/108.Sto.ogg"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_72b51145:


    Frost "All of this will be yours. You only need but wish."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_93c86371:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/110.S.ogg"
    Frost "You only need but ask."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_59da6d7d:


    "And then he whispered."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_b1397791:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/111.St.ogg"
    Frost "You only need but accept..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_cbdf6955:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/47 So.ogg"
    Oly "Accept..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_e3244562:


    "Olya repeated after him like an echo, as if enchanted."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_053a3bd9:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/112.Da.ogg"
    Frost "Yes, my dear girl."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_1139145d:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/113.Vk.ogg"
    Frost "Partake of this feast."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_e3041117:


    "The old man pointed toward the fox girl."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_1cf6ee97:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/93 ya.ogg"
    Alis "Please, I beg of you, for all of us… for me, for your sister..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_549bd4a5:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/94 Zai.ogg"
    Alis "Please, Bunny, take just a single bite."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_refuse_57e9bc3a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/95 E.ogg"
    Alis "And you’ll understand everything."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_ce438f89:


    "I felt like chilling winds blew from the cavities of her eyes, from the dark holes of other beasts, and the towering old man's, too."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_fd9558e1:


    "The owl’s face twitched nervously."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_85148a9d:


    "The wolf’s maw dripped with saliva."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_24754e1e:


    "The bear shuffled his feet, any trace of sleepiness gone from his face."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_b525ce9d:


    "And from behind us towered the one who pretended to be Grandpa Frost all this time."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_f44e26fc:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/192. Yaska.ogg"
    Ant "I said, we’re leaving."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_c87fa6d8:


    "I gripped my sister’s hand even tighter. Candy slipped out of her fingers and smacked against the floor."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_1fac5dde:


    "Olya started looking around, frightened."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_962fbd05:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/YaSkazal.ogg"
    Alis "I said, we’re leaving!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_78822135:


    "Alisa parroted me and, despite everything, I felt immense anger."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_55bc746e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/96 oh.ogg"
    Alis "My, why do you have to be..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_11fd4757:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/96 Du.ogg"
    Alis "...such a dunce?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_0616de1d:


    "I heard the flute’s melody, but now it reminded me of a cracking whip or even agonized convulsions of a fish that was thrown out to the ice."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_c5358f32:


    "Music dangled about, striking at my ears."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_02820830:


    "And then the crystal castle was filled with cries of children that slowly turned into beastly howls, intermingled with the sounds of crunching bones and ripping skin."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_f231ce12:


    "The china platter, filled to the brim with maggots, smashed into tiny pieces."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_bce776aa:


    "Alisa’s orange fur coat ripped at the seams, letting out a cloud of foul-smelling fog."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_aee3844a:


    "Her twisted face bared its teeth and the stench attacked my nostrils again."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_54d659fe:


    "The fox screamed, blood streaming down her cheeks like tears, making her fur sticky. Her bone-naked tail whipped against the walls with its vertebrae."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_a59f651a:


    "I shielded my crying sister."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_bef2ec97:


    "Horror drilled into my stomach, rushed through my guts, and rose up to my throat."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_ebf6be37:


    "I felt the urge to tear off my glasses and lose sight. I wanted to squeeze my eyes out and go blind forever."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_be1c6b2a:


    "I turned to face the owl and my face contorted from disgust."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_189bfd7c:


    "Worms wriggled inside her mask’s feathers. Her rotten beak snapped like garden scissors."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_df6e86d7:


    "I staggered back and barely avoided bumping into the wolf."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_241f171c:


    "His face was stretching out, his bones crunched."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_b4d9f208:


    "Teeth poked out of his festering gums like shards of broken glass, and his swollen tongue kept on tirelessly licking them."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_c5e51060:


    "At the edge of my vision, I saw the bear block our passage. Every inch of his body oozed scarlet ichor. Larvae clogged his teary eyes."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_55abac6d:


    "I pulled the shocked Olya close, looking for the exit in a panic."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_3213d126:


    "My foot ended up in a pile of sweets, but those were no longer candy."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_fb3f6838:


    "Human remains blanketed the floor."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_484a684b:


    "Ribs with shreds of meat on them and torn-out jaws."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_4af5c2b0:


    "A tooth necklace and moss-covered pelvic bones."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_9cbbef12:


    "Tiny skulls and scalps, swimming in a sea of blood."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_1b099c1f:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/114.Esh.ogg"
    Noname "Eat up!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_8510d9be:


    "The horned monstrosity towered over me, clutching a bone flute in its long-clawed fingers."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_45302f53:


    "A giant goat that shed his kind old man form."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_98bc1a52:


    "Completely black, emanating hatred and malice, he scorched me with red-hot coals inside his eye cavities."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_b70dc29e:


    "His horns scraped against the ceiling."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_3f42e7e8:


    "Ice cracked and thawed, dripping down, forming muddy pools of water, baring metal walls that were hidden underneath it."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_97ad0eea:


    "I realized that we were doomed inside this cramped womb of a dungeon, surrounded by howling beasts."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_e1741870:


    "All I could do was hug my sister even tighter and watch how the circle around us shrank, how ugly paws reached out to us from behind the veil of a bloody fog."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_665517fa:



    voice "voice/Wolf/327 Poz.ogg"
    Wolf "Let me grr-rip them to shreds, Master!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_d369c89e:



    voice "voice/Wolf/328 Ya.ogg"
    Wolf "I’ll tea-grr their eyeballs and sc-grr-ew their oozing wounds!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_c69e8c93:



    voice "voice/Wolf/329 Y.ogg"
    Wolf "I... I..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_f50465c0:


    "The growling wolf's maw snapped like a bear trap, splattering thick white foam toward us."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_1bd8c6a4:


    "But he was immediately pushed away by a rotting bear carcass."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_52a78413:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/45 Dudki.ogg"
    Bear "No way! It’s my turn to have fun."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_19696ed1:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/46 Kak.ogg"
    Bear "I got so tired of listening to their fucking drivel!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_ab6fd684:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/47 YaZiv.ogg"
    Bear "Oh, I’ll rip the skin off this little brat while she’s still alive, right in front of her brother."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_b720ed44:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/48 Ya.ogg"
    Bear "I’ll make him eat his own sister. I’ll fill his belly full of her guts."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_5795d50f:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/49 Po.ogg"
    Bear "Please, Master..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_aaa1e26a:


    "It felt like his face was about to tear apart, crack like an eggshell, letting out something even more sinister, nasty, scary..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_8b388ac1:


    "Gnarly owl claws grabbed at the grinning bear, stopping him from getting close."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_ebf7ba0a:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/Ona.ogg"
    Owl "She’s mine! Mine, you scumbags!!!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_5ba69117:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/Lapi.ogg"
    Owl "Get your paws off the girl!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_fc53d2d8:


    "The cackling zoo formed a furball that started rolling in guts and thawed fat."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_6741ebcc:


    "They howled, fought with each other, tore out scrapes of fur and feathers, ready to rip each other apart like a pack of hungry dogs fighting for leftovers."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_3ea19181:


    "A sudden squeal of the flute pulled them apart as if someone tugged at their leashes."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_7eb5656f:


    "The master of this pack charmed the monsters with his soul-rending music, turning them into unmoving, silent marionettes that faithfully awaited his commands."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_bda71c81:


    "The goat stopped nibbling on his shin bone flute."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_241d583c:


    "Its devilish melody that sounded like a chorus of children being run over by a steamroller, went silent for one last time."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_95821f91:


    "A chunk of raw human flesh plopped beside my shaking feet."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_7612253d:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/115.EshEli.ogg"
    Master "Eat. Or be eaten."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_52cd3889:


    "Consumed by fear, I turned toward Olya. She lay by the wayside, covered in pink snow."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_31f5f9ae:


    "Just like the Sleeping Beauty in that cartoon."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_f403aa40:


    "She probably lost consciousness from this soul-rending spectacle."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_fa524e37:


    "I wanted to wail, to go mad, to die quickly and painlessly, right there and now..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_c2a5f507:


    "But alas, I couldn’t."


translate english d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_069871b1:


    "I was still inside this torture chamber, choosing between a gruesome end inside the monsters’ stomachs and cannibalism."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_a997034c:


    "Woolen meat grinders kept on staring at me with their greedy, infinitely hungry eyes, ready to gnaw at my bones before eventually eating them, if I dared refuse their Master’s offer."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_413ed66e:


    "But if I was to agree, I’m sure I would lose my free will, just like them."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_3311f8fd:


    "I’ll turn into a perpetually hungry monster that dances to the tune of a bloodthirsty madman."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_01045f27:


    "And I’ll surely lead Olya and all those who I hold dear to their deaths..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_bd7d872b:


    "My lips trembled, a feeling of nausea turned my stomach inside-out, but somehow I found the strength to scream."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_f131fd89:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/193. Niko.ogg"
    Ant "No way! Never! I’m a human!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_f2bd10e5:


    "Those words could be later used as my epitaph, but I knew that my remains were destined to never be found."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_9837c682:


    "My surroundings went dead silent."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_e017039d:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/116.Este.ogg"
    Master "Eat them! Bleaaat them! Tear them apart!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_783a2c62:


    "The horned shadow consumed us."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_c77abe06:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/119.Sl.ogg"
    Master "Sweet meat!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_45c71d44:


    "Alisa rushed to the goat and stood between us, ridiculously tiny compared to the giant monster."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_a65d984c:


    "Her tail dragged after her, leaving behind a scarlet trail. Fleas jumped around her back and the bones sticking out of it."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_a0fb8e77:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/98 podo.ogg"
    Alis "Wait! Don't, no need to be hasty."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_03b90b2a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/99 Zai.ogg"
    Alis "We still have use for the Bunny. He will bring us a tasty treat."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_5b77d29e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/101 Dlya.ogg"
    Alis "For the fox and for the bear..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_11cb0e52:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/120.Za.ogg"
    Master "Bunny, tasty meals prepare."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_d915096d:


    "Flames inside his eye sockets stopped trembling."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_7c205de3:


    "Still dolls bared their teeth in anger."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_0611b9f8:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/51 Da.ogg"
    Bear "You call him Bunny?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_b9c59f44:



    voice "voice/Wolf/332 Raz.ogg"
    Wolf "Tea-grr apart and swallow up!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_97a893bf:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/Samozv.ogg"
    Owl "Impostor! Hoot-hoot!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_ec867ba6:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/Kozan.ogg"
    Owl "Gut-filled meatbag."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_5bd4cea2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/102 Zat.ogg"
    Alis "Shut up, buffoons!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_df7ade10:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/103 Razv.ogg"
    Alis "Can’t you feel it? Have you forgotten?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_34952e2a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/104 Kogda.ogg"
    Alis "The moment when he almost took a bite out of the Moon at that snowy clearing."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_1cc67b9a:


    "The cannibals went silent, swallowing saliva in disappointment."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_f334c70a:


    "Alisa, in the meantime, took a sharp turn and..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_990b8d86:


    "...returned to the form of a cute child with a fox mask on that I met for the first time one January morning."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_65663d5d:


    "She glided toward me, dissolving the horrors around us with the smell of tangerines, firecrackers, and magic."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_e1922f08:


    "Her soft paws touched my cheeks, removed a sticky strand of hair from my forehead."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_9d88dd15:


    "Alisa embraced me and whispered in a sweet voice."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_8b3e23e4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/105 Tosha.ogg"
    Alis "Do you want to save yourself, Tosha?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_3f7b8045:


    "I stayed silent, gritting my teeth. I was afraid to look away, afraid that this fleeting illusion could get shattered."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_a86dcc2d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/106 Moi.ogg"
    Alis "Tell me, sweetie, do you want to save your sister?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_a061ae89:


    "Tears sprayed from my eyes as I wept."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_13b314a7:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/195. Da.ogg"
    Ant "Y-yes..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_abbbf4c8:


    "I continued to sniffle and shake, grabbing at the hem of the fox girl’s long coat."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_f61a8d75:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/107 Ska.ogg"
    Alis "Say it louder so that everybody could hear you."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_eafcb284:


    "Delirious from sorrow, I screamed, my face awash with tears."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_cbe37d72:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/196.Daa.ogg"
    Ant "YES!!!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_f4ee5986:


    "My mouth was immediately filled with the metallic aftertaste of blood."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_30472b40:


    "The fox’s black fingers kept pushing a chunk of human flesh deeper down my throat."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_50d4e61a:


    "I fell to my knees, coughing up blood, unable to vomit it out."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_cd201783:


    "Rotting carcasses of animals surrounded me once again."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_62ee8d41:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/Kakoe.ogg"
    Owl "What a joke."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_abd8aa04:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/Pozvol.ogg"
    Owl "Master, let me take a small bite from the girl."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_01244402:


    "Boiling anger swallowed up my mind, something foreign and primitive burst forth, pounced from inside me."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_f1e82cec:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/198. Tolko.ogg"
    Bunny "Let me see you try! I’ll tear out your filthy tongue and shove it deep down your cloaca, you brainless chicken! "


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_25aae670:


    "The ominous owl jumped away in surprise, accompanied by the fox’s cackling."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_c5a73fda:


    "My voice went out and then I bent in half."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_5bd19a19:


    "Vomit poured out of my mouth, along with part of the \"treat\" that I wasn’t able to regurgitate."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_cbe7e2da:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/122.Ti.ogg"
    Master "You’re right. Bunny..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_2b091a86:


    voice "voice/kozel/4day/124.Dih2.ogg"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_1ec87298:


    "His finger poked me. I felt like a knife was lodged handle-deep into my solar plexus."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_c83db7cd:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/123.Tv.ogg"
    Master "It's your turn to treat us."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_4b63b882:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/Dob.ogg"
    Master "Get us some meat until tomorrow night..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_c0585745:



    voice "voice/Wolf/342 Inche.ogg"
    Wolf "Or else..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_eea69925:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/59 Enache.ogg"
    Bear "Or else..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_0e566ede:


    "Alisa silently stepped into the shadows, and the Goat put his foul-smelling maw right into my face and roared."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_6985d7b0:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/125.ME.ogg"
    Master "Or else... we’ll eat your entire family."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_15b5cb8c:


    "He knocked his hoof against the floor and I ran for my life, forgetting about everything else."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_64493087:


    "I heard them scream at my back: \"We’ll eat you up! Alive!\""


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_9ec5d5cf:


    "Shards of ice fell on my shoulders, dead rodents frozen inside them."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_ab816d48:


    "I managed to break free, to the place where pines moved their branches and showered me with snow, like cooks sprinkling salt on porridge."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_aff4a46b:


    "The wind tore at my hair."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_412dadaa:


    "I turned around and froze over."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_fcde6f34:


    "The Garage was disappearing right in front of me, dissolving in layers, becoming dim and then transparent, before a gust of wind finally swept away the phantom of black walls."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_1ee64e2d:


    "Only then I realized that I let go of my sister a long time ago and she was left behind in the monsters’ den."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_aa93c097:


    "There was only a giant snow pile left in place of the castle."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_ea144750:


    "A girl’s wrist poked out of it, like a cross would poke out of a burial mound."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_d9b08cc9:


    "Terrified, I rushed over to the snow pile and started digging."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_cb5bb596:


    "Olya’s pale face, along with one of her shoulders, appeared from under the white mass."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_8ea511d4:


    "Her blue-ish lips trembled."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_7e8f590e:


    "She’s alive!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_1c884de6:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/200. Ya.ogg"
    Ant "Hang in there!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_a88bafa3:


    "My throat went dry when I remembered that I shouted these same words to Katya before."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_dcb95226:


    "I continued digging and prayed for her to hang on."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_9d725fa4:


    "At some point, I was able to see her stomach."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_7780ba78:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/69Hol.ogg"
    Oly "I’m cold..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_b875e0ff:


    "Her voice was faint."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_9bb50de1:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/201. Niche.ogg"
    Ant "It’s okay."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_6e666fe7:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/201. Otn.ogg"
    Ant "I’ll carry you home, we’ll get you warm by drinking hot chocolate, just stay awake for me, you hear?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_18e3b99a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/202. Tito.ogg"
    Ant "Just..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_48b6b4e6:


    "My fingers came across something sticky and hot."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_6430601d:


    "I cleared out more snow, it turned red and mushy."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_47984faa:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/50 Cho.ogg"
    Oly "What’s this? What’s there?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_71e470a7:


    "I gulped."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_7b2f9d83:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/51Poch.ogg"
    Oly "Why won’t you say anything?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_4d57b057:


    "How could I tell her?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_11b3ed5d:


    "Olya’s body didn’t exist below the stomach. Rings of guts fell out of the wound."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_fa17375e:


    "Olya tilted her head and stared at the horrifying sсraps."


translate english d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_078c17ed:


    "Then let out a deafening scream."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_66d4ecfe:


    "I fished out the most tasty-looking candy from the pile of sweets on the floor."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_53bc90e1:


    Narr_color "Then took a bite. Milk chocolate melted in my mouth."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_08ff04bf:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/127.S.ogg"
    Frost_Color "I applaud your bold decision, now it's time for you to play!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_98e8b7e3:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/127Ya.ogg"
    Frost_Color "I will grant your deepest wishes, let me lighten up your day!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_27f9b16d:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/53 A.ogg"
    Olya_Color "Anton, look!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_54f9f06d:


    Narr_color "My sister's face was smeared in chocolate and I was about to reprimand her."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_55c6ea22:


    Narr_color "But words got stuck in my throat."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_0103e7e7:


    Narr_color "A giant spruce shot toward the stars and disappeared somewhere in outer space, crowned by a giant Moon."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_6ada7549:


    Narr_color "Giant balls shined on its branches, garlands of lights gleamed with all the colors of the rainbow."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_22f3c2c1:


    Narr_color "The roof disappeared and myriads of constellations sprawled on the night sky above us."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_a8a2c098:


    Narr_color "Music, laughter, the smell of evergreen, and sweets!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_06bfd58f:


    Narr_color "And Teddy, Wolfy, and Hooty dancing beside us!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_ee73c3fd:


    Narr_color "And the snowflakes floating backward!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_16ce1472:


    Narr_color "I burst out laughing, touched the bushy golden tinsel."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_2d285326:


    Narr_color "It was all real!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_47891a70:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/54 E.ogg"
    Olya_Color "Is... Is that it?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_dde37a40:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/109 Vi.ogg"
    Alis_Color "Are you talking about Neverland, by any chance?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_c18eab2a:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/55 Et.ogg"
    Olya_Color "Is this Neverland?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_19456adc:


    Narr_color "Alisa performed a theatric bow."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_5d59eb1f:


    Narr_color "Christmas balls gleamed and shimmered, and my soul shimmered in unison with them."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_4a06f805:


    Narr_color "I was becoming the magic winter forest, the soft evergreen, all of the constellations at the same time."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_357bf83f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/110 Dobro.ogg"
    Alis_Color "Welcome home!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_10e8c83f:


    Narr_color "This is where my home always was."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_8f2e04c3:


    Narr_color "The snow sparkled, almost blinding me."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_8bd57f33:


    Narr_color "Olya started spinning in a dance. She grabbed a candy with each of her hands."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_c550b507:


    Narr_color "Wolfy juggled Kinder Surprise eggs."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_fe2b7f12:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/56 T.ogg"
    Olya_Color "Did you see that?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_d6ff85ac:


    Narr_color "Consoles, handheld games, dolls, and transformer figures lay under the spruce as if they were brought here by trucks."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_00147dd7:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/57 Et.ogg"
    Olya_Color "Is this for us?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_1b531a90:


    Narr_color "I realized I was also dancing so I replied while moving."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_73cbd79c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/204.Mn.ogg"
    Ant_Color "It's a bit too much for just the two of us. I'd share it with somebody. And what do you think?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_4774a691:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/58 Nu.ogg"
    Olya_Color "Only if it's somebody nice."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_293eefa7:


    Narr_color "A group of children stood at the edge of the woods, their enchanted gazes directed at our celebration."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_43afc1b0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/204. Ei.ogg"
    Ant_Color "Hey!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_74749d13:


    Narr_color "I jumped across the whole clearing and glided to the ground near them."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_6b167378:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/205. Ho.ogg"
    Ant_Color "Wanna come to us?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_02fb7e8c:



    voice "voice/Child/4day/Amozno.ogg"
    Children_Color "Can we?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_ff9769b5:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/206. Spr.ogg"
    Ant_Color "Of course!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_61db897b:


    Narr_color "The kids took each other by the hand. I led their procession toward the gifts."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_40131396:


    Narr_color "There was no better feeling than leading someone on the road to their dreams."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_49461f10:


    Narr_color "The holiday party was finally in full swing."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_3aeb1411:


    Narr_color "In every holiday, just like in a beautiful apple, always sat a nasty little worm called transience."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_7f47709e:


    Narr_color "Yet here, under the bristly paws of a magnificent spruce, holidays never ended."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_d16cb81c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/111 TiS.ogg"
    Alis_Color "Are you happy, Tosha?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_188c437e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/207. Ya.ogg"
    Ant_Color "I am!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_8c6d6639:


    Narr_color "Up in the sky, majestic fireworks went off, illuminating the dancing figures."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_aacfb3c7:


    Narr_color "My eyes wettened. My muscles sprung up."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_129c97d0:


    Narr_color "I tilted my head backward to look at the Moon and screamed at the top of my lungs from overflowing emotion."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_c29124a4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/112 TiScha.ogg"
    Alis_Color "Are you happy, Bunny?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_483db378:


    Narr_color "I jumped toward the stars and did a flip."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_a712df1a:


    Narr_color "All of Neverland could hear my scream."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_86b66b5c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/210. Sha.ogg"
    Ant_Color "I am happy!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_01df1769:


    "For the first time in the long days I'd spent in the new house, I woke up with a smile on my face."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_9dd2b6f0:


    "This time, happiness had a tight grip on me. I stretched, enjoying the sweet sensation with every cell of my body."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_4b60ada1:


    "Outside, I could hear the joyful chirping of beautiful red-chested bullfinches, who celebrated the bright January sun."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_32d67ece:


    "Their chirping granted me hope that the naked forest outside my window would someday turn into a lush paradise for my parents and my little sister."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_75ae0c94:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/Hahaha.ogg"
    "The corridor was filled with dog barks and the patter of tiny feet."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_fce1ee67:


    "The door to my bedroom flew open, greeting me with a warm breeze and the aroma of freshly made coffee."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_68fe269f:


    "Olya stood in the doorway, shining with happiness, holding the cute Zhulka who wiggled both her body and her tail."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_c39db5d0:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/60 To.ogg"
    Oly "Look, Tosha, look! Papa said she can stay!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_b6cb706d:


    "Tears of joy formed in my little sister's eyes."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_34a728f5:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/61Um.ogg"
    Oly "I have my own dog now!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_e22b065f:


    "I couldn't help but jump up from bed upon hearing this wonderful news."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_fe749e65:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/211. Da.ogg"
    Ant "That's Zhulka!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_ea636bf4:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/62 S.ogg"
    Oly "Zhulka? No, her name is Princess."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_2d996e58:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/63 Da.ogg"
    Oly "Right, Your Highness?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_8eeadfd5:


    "The dog barked in agreement."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_35def0c0:



    voice "voice/father/day4/81Tuk.ogg"
    Pap "Knock-knock! Can I come in?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_268ab008:


    "To my complete surprise, Dad stepped through the doorway, smiling and hugging Mom, which was outright bizarre."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_51d18933:



    voice "voice/father/day4/82 Kak.ogg"
    Pap "What do you think of our new family member?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_f6b2183e:



    voice "voice/father/day4/83 Mn.ogg"
    Pap "This idiot threw herself under my car, I barely avoided her."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_0b7103eb:



    voice "voice/father/day4/84M.ogg"
    Pap "I got my car scratched. Thought I'd choke her with my own two hands."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_323adb41:



    voice "voice/father/day4/84 A.ogg"
    Pap "Then I looked her in the eye... And there I saw... How should I put it..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_abab32c6:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/131 Um.ogg"
    Mam "...intelligence."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_62b284ed:



    voice "voice/father/day4/85 Vo.ogg"
    Pap "Yeah! And the poor thing was shaking all over."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_777f481e:



    voice "voice/father/day4/85 Nu.ogg" 
    Pap "And then I said: all right, if you manage to make it home without soiling my seats, I'll let you stay."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_c3d03b4b:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/64 Pr.ogg"
    Oly "Princesses can't soil anything!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_712c5bf8:


    "We laughed in unison, just like in the good old days when every little thing could easily make us burst out laughing."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_0e22e1cd:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/133 Che.ogg"
    Mam "Well, why did you stop? Continue with your stories."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_7f69b738:


    "Mom gave Dad a cunning look and he turned away, red as a beet. They were acting like total kids."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_c8e40f10:



    voice "voice/father/day4/87 A.ogg"
    Pap "There's more good news. Your dad got a promotion."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_76b2ded0:



    voice "voice/father/day4/88 Gre.ogg"
    Pap "I shouldn't exactly be happy about it since the chief accountant went missing and all."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_8219fb01:



    voice "voice/father/day4/88 No.ogg"
    Pap "But, you know, for us it's a silver lining."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_18b403dc:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/213. Eto.ogg"
    Ant "Does that mean you'll be away from home more?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_bfdf91f7:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/134 Eto.ogg"
    Mam "That means double the bonuses."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_02848bab:



    voice "voice/father/day4/89 Pra.ogg"
    Pap "That's right, Karina!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_aa2d6521:



    voice "voice/father/day4/89 Ta.ogg"
    Pap "Which means you all should prepare for a family trip next week."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_aba3e762:


    "My heart started beating faster after those words."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_29600eb8:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/214. Kuda.ogg"
    Ant "W-Where?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_e117af81:


    "Olya even loosened her grip on the stray."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_bc12e151:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/66 Neu.ogg"
    Oly "Oh, are we going to Mcdonald's?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_53edb999:



    voice "voice/father/day4/90 S.ogg"
    Pap "Come on, Olya."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_99fc744a:



    voice "voice/father/day4/90 Mi.ogg"
    Pap "Aim higher! We've been planning this trip for a long time, but something always messed it up"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_430a3ba3:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/135 Ve.ogg"
    Mam "We're so sorry about that, kids."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_7e20c7ee:


    "Mom wiped away a tear with her fist."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_787d9a18:



    voice "voice/father/day4/90Da.ogg"
    Pap "It's okay, Karina. Now it's all in the past."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_41e9ccd8:



    voice "voice/father/day4/91 V.ogg" 
    Pap "Anyway, gather your things, we're flying to Disneyland!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_0b553c41:


    "My sister and I jumped up to the ceiling with joy. The dog also got excited from that passionate speech and joined us."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_5f6000a8:


    AntOly "Hurray!!!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_1f112f81:


    AntOly "Disneyland!!! Disneyland!!!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_0489bd48:


    "Our jubilant screams filled the house, rushed through the attic and the drain pipes, flew across the front yard, and sneaked into the shining white forest."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_8914d320:


    "Taking the scary D-word away with it."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_2205018c:


    "I swore that I'll remember this day forever. The day when my parents finally dropped their derisive masks and underneath them were the faces of parents we always knew and loved."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_25ff058c:


    "Lilia Pavlovna still hadn't returned to school after Katya went missing so today I was able to get a good night's sleep and went to school when it was already bright outside."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_1f27a777:


    "The trail led to a snow-white plain with blackened houses in the background. They pumped out gray smoke that carried the smell of birch and pine logs."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_999688ea:


    "The freezing cold of the night had finally let up. It fell into slumber under the early sunlight. Ice sparkles appeared on the white caps atop the houses."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_d2065a21:


    "I stopped, confident that nobody could spoil my good mood today."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_93aa11e9:


    "Not even my personal tormentor, Pyatifanov, or his nasty crony, Byasha."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_82a28b7b:


    "Not even the shining knife that threatened to cut me up like a dead fish."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_e9b16592:


    "Not even the mix of disdain and pity in Polina's rare glances. All of that was left in the past, forgotten like a bad dream."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_e9572dcc:


    "No sadness, no self-pity because of Polina, who was probably already sharing all of her grand plans about conquering Vienna with Romka."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_c8754a5f:


    "All of that was gone forever."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_9040afed:


    "A cow let out a long moo somewhere in the distance."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_6d2f523c:


    "I fell out of my fleeting daydream and walked forward, crunching with the snow blanket under my soles."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_c4585769:


    "Fluffy clouds floated above my head, I recognized the friendly shapes of animal kids in them."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_a7103825:


    "Suddenly, a snowball landed on the back of my head. Girlish laughter that reminded me of a small ringing bell in the spring breeze tickled my ears."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_7e4e0d94:


    "I turned around, expecting to see her, my lovely guide into the dream world, my dear Alisa."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_6e60a630:


    "Yet instead of a fox girl, Polina stood on the trodden path behind me, with her faithful violin case in hand."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_a2464e88:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/178 Op.ogg"
    Pol "Got your head in the clouds again, huh, Petrov?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_8332352e:


    "She lunged at me with contagious laughter, locking her arms around my neck. I just stood there in awe, drowning in the sweet aroma of her perfume."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_d8f95a7b:


    "Just yesterday I was stupefied by her sudden hysteric episode, and I thought it was wise to stay away from Polina."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_c62bb6f5:


    "Away from her mood swings, away from her weirdo of a grandpa..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_48624517:


    "Yet as soon as she hugged me, I forgot about all the horrors and didn't want this talented violinist to let me go."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_c225322e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/216. Chto.ogg"
    Ant "D-did something happen?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_ca7f805e:


    "She flashed me an embarrassed smile. I saw her cornflower-colored eyes gleam."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_4bf2414b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/179 De.ogg"
    Pol "My grandpa, he..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_853efe52:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/180 On.ogg"
    Pol "He can walk again, can you believe it?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_61494940:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/181 V.ogg"
    Pol "The local doctor had no faith in him, but it's like he stood up and started walking just to spite him."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_769c0dd5:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/182 O.ogg"
    Pol "Oh, this is the happiest day of my life, Anton!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_2a0a2c13:


    "She dug her face deep into my chest, tightened her grip on my neck as if I was more than just a friend to her."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_302def22:


    "I stared looking around, anxious."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_88957670:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/217. Pol.ogg"
    Ant "Um, Polina... Somebody could see us."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_6169e973:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/183 Iz.ogg"
    Pol "Are you worried about Pyatifanov?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_f868a8c7:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/184 B.ogg"
    Pol "Then you're worried for nothing. He has not been seen for a while."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_2361350f:


    "I cautiously parted with Polina, trying to understand whether it was some sort of prank or the truth."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_4972a937:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/185 Nu.ogg"
    Pol "Wait, you don't believe me?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_26262b0c:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/186 K.ogg"
    Pol "That officer, Lieutenant Tikhonov, came to our house just last night."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_7551beaa:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/187 T.ogg"
    Pol "He said that Byasha, along with his buddy, Romka, went missing."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_1452c88b:


    "A group of skiers glided past us straight into the forest."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_4071b33b:


    "Polina leaned into my ear, sharing her whisper with me, her eyes still locked on the skiers."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_b06d6b9a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/188 K.ogg"
    Pol "As far as I know, Tikhonov suspects that all the previous cases were Pyatifanov's fault."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_1c8de83e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/218. Da.ogg"
    Ant "No way!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_68707aa7:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/189 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I was shocked myself."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_a2c1d04d:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/190 po.ogg"
    Pol "There are rumors that Romka, well, went off the deep end."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_0e8cb505:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/191 Da.ogg"
    Pol "I mean, I'm not exactly surprised to hear that..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_d94ef132:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/219. Cto.ogg"
    Ant "What do you mean?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_0bbc1b2a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/192 A.ogg"
    Pol "Haven't you heard? He's from a very troubled family."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_b2cf902a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/193 D.ogg"
    Pol "I don't even want to imagine what had been going on in their home."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_443744bd:


    "Romka always seemed excessively aggressive to me, always angry at everyone without a good reason."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_5f2c7350:


    "Now, the darkness that he harbored within overflowed into the outside world and led multiple small innocent souls to their demise, as well as his own."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_251e5e68:


    "It was hard to believe, but the first time I laid my eyes on Romka, I thought that things would end this way."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_454fd863:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/194 V.ogg"
    Pol "Yeah, and you wanted me to date him."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_f421ab9d:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/195 K.ogg"
    Pol "I shudder every time I remember that!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_e0105ab2:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/220. Proste.ogg"
    Ant "I'm so sorry."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_d33b61a3:


    "She waved her hand and smiled."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_28d169ac:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/196 K.ogg"
    Pol "All in the past now..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_2128be7e:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/197 Vo.ogg"
    Pol "I only wish all of the stray dogs could disappear, too."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_ae597115:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/198 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "Now that would be a wonderful world."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_9dcc3c4a:


    "I looked at Polina with suspicion."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_36a661c4:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/199 Da.ogg"
    Pol "Ahaha, I'm just joking!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_96a64b51:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/200 Po.ogg"
    Pol "Let's move, or we're gonna be late."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_e3199064:


    "Polina grabbed my hand and started running along the village road, accompanied by joyful laughter."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_6b0a1f64:


    "With every step, every laugh, and every joke, the warmth I thought I'd forgotten enveloped my heart more and more."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_8817b151:


    "The all-consuming feeling of falling in love came back to me, this time for good, it seemed."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_51a25aed:


    "I tried letting go of Polina's hand near the classroom entrance, embarrassed that our classmates might taunt us."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_2cb39d8d:


    "But it was as if Polina didn't care at all, she only gripped my palm even harder while opening the door."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_613cf513:


    "And she was right, now that the cunning Katya, the heartless Romka, and the sneering Byasha were gone, our class looked as if it was sanitized from parasites, it became friendlier and kinder."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_a1961258:


    "I didn't get looks overflowing with hatred anymore, there was nobody to spit a ball of chewed paper at me through an empty shell of a ball pen."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_00055050:


    "I sat at my lonely desk when Polina joined me. I wasn't surprised at all."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_b02bad6b:


    "She was so charming that I could call her my muse."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_16c3b87e:


    "A wave of inspiration hit me, and I couldn't help but pull my sketchbook out of my bag."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_23882562:


    "I licked the penсil lead, my eyes glued to my model."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_55bc1f67:


    "She smiled at me again."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_efca3a5a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/201 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "What's on your mind?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_8b1ed9e0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/221. Spok.ogg"
    Ant "No worries! A professional at work here."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_84ec3c27:


    "I drafted the shapes of her mesmerizing figure."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_fa3c6cb4:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/222. Znae.ogg"
    Ant "You know, I've watched you from here often."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_028accea:


    "She glanced at her former desk, then fixed a strand of hair behind her ear in embarrassment."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_29de6df2:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/202 P.ogg"
    Pol "Really?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_dc6c2fe3:


    "I outlined her cute cheeks with multiple wide lines."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_4f6db853:


    "It was the first time I was able to grasp somebody's proportions so precisely."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_0c81f832:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/223. Po.ogg"
    Ant "Polina..."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_25f6adff:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/203 Cht.ogg"
    Pol "Yes, Anton?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_2bd5bd45:


    "She froze in place, afraid of disrupting my work with one wrong move and dispelling the magic of the moment."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_afd10d4d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/244.Na.ogg"
    Ant "Lean here a bit more, please."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_2871abde:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/244.Vot.ogg"
    Ant "Yes, like this. Good."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_52b18d53:


    "Choking from anxiousness, Polina loosened the knot on her neckerchief."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_24710dbc:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/225. Yav.ogg"
    Ant "I always wanted to... draw you."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_c5569c6a:


    "Our eyes met."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_2eaf5093:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/205 O.ogg"
    Pol "Oh, Anton."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_6f509d93:


    "My pencil slid across the paper furiously, adding the shading to her chest."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_8a1c2278:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/226. Ska.ogg"
    Ant "Say, would you like to become the main heroine in my comic?"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_e52f61fa:


    "Pleasant shivers ran across her body. She rolled her eyes back, enraptured."


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_2238a926:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/206 Da.ogg"
    Pol "Yes, yes!"


translate english d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_f5494d58:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/207 K.ogg"
    Pol "I've been waiting for you to ask, darling!"


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_39d70300:


    "The lead couldn't endure all of the tension and cracked, bursting into a million tiny pieces."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_cec102ee:


    "I couldn't believe my eyes when I looked at the drawing."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_e6aaafef:


    "I was looking at a terrible daub. In the place where Polina's face was just a second ago, now rested some sort of formless mess."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_a20cefa7:


    "..."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_999eb8cb:


    "It took me some time to realize that I was sitting alone in an empty classroom."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_885977c8:


    "With only the specks of dust flying in the moonlight as my company."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_49cad19b:


    "It was dark outside. My classmates, Polina, the feeling of euphoria—all of them were gone."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_d8474f85:


    "Somebody wrote down a nursery rhyme on the blackboard with a piece of chalk, but some of the words were wiped out and I could only read bits and pieces."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_3691f083:


    "One, two."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_fa6b925e:


    "Bunny."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_61ff1306:


    "Meat..."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_19012565:


    "I was no longer smirking like an idiot."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_d8c361de:


    "I stood up, pinched myself on the wrist. A ringing silence engulfed me."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_cef95e6b:


    "There was a taste of vomit in my mouth, and my ears buzzed like from an endless scream, full of despair and horror."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_1707b594:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/228. Ei.ogg"
    Ant "Hey! Is there anybody out here?"


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_fb32e943:


    "Shadows swarmed in the corridor."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_7fe27bf1:


    "I walked past boarded-up classrooms, past the rotten spots on the walls and silvery cobwebs."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_b63c0781:


    "Spiders crawled under the ceiling."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_8311e97a:


    "Lamps flickered anxiously."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_c65f54c3:


    "I stopped before the notice board, stunned."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_21880413:


    "Hundreds of new photos were added to those of Semyon and Katya."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_92784406:


    "Black-and-white print-outs were glued on top of each other. The horrific collage of childish faces stared at me with empty eye sockets."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_cc1dbefb:


    "Unable to endure the torturing stares of those watchful gaping holes, I ran out of the school."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_6339484f:


    "I crossed the front yard and reached the road where the wind was whipping up powdery snow."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_850d519b:


    "No people, no cars, no birds..."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_115ab510:


    "Low clouds got stuck on chimneys."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_becdc878:


    "Windows that looked like they were painted over with ink."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_43e47e3b:


    "Photos of missing people enveloped lamp posts and fences like paper skin. Mostly kids, but some adults, too."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_b950abca:


    "It felt like all the people who once lived in this village now became black-and-white ghosts in the photos with a \"Person Missing\" label."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_9c4654ea:


    "I dragged my feet forward along the dead street."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_3a25123c:


    "Some houses had their windows smashed. The wind made itself at home there, wandering the rooms."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_0475d2f7:


    "Every gust made the front doors swing."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_86a5abb7:


    "Kids' coats hung from the fences, their sleeves moved, stretched out toward me."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_e4177609:


    "An empty village. An empty husk."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_c5409ea9:


    "What happened here?"


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_a849d7c5:


    "An overthrown waste bin rumbled across the back alley."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_29def6b7:


    "Something flashed inside the window frames of the charred village store."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_f555d830:


    "I ran away from its sooty facade."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_e464d36d:


    "Then heard a guttural roar coming from the well."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_239747bb:


    "I started walking faster, trying not to pay any mind to the darkness inside the front yards, inside the bloodied dog houses, inside the crooked shacks."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_1fa3da8c:


    "The Moon appeared from under the clouds."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_82fec4c0:


    "Something flew over my head in this draining silence..."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_774d5484:


    "As if a crop duster flew from one roof to another. A huge shadow loomed over me."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_23e91c6a:


    "I rushed to the right, hoping that I wasn't noticed."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_85b854b7:


    "A small green house in front of me was my shelter."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_e522e3dd:


    "I rushed towards the closest building, going insane from fear. Yes, nobody will find me there!"


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_a5790e6a:


    "I failed to notice right away that it was Polina's house, where just hours ago she was begging me to stay with her during a fit of hysteria."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_1b97b0a3:


    "I rushed towards the closest building, going insane from fear."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_2ff418ac:


    "I pushed the gate, crouched and scampered toward the porch."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_09ed1aa8:


    "I tugged at the doorknob. The front door was open."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_100cb105:


    "A wheelchair rolled out of the darkness, almost hitting me, tumbled down the stairs, clanging with its wheels, and stopped near an apple tree."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_34e45cd9:


    "I followed it with round eyes. Then turned my gaze inside the house again."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_a2b73e19:


    "The corridor was obscured by the dark. Empty frames on the walls. Glass shards on the floor."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_88aee1a0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/229. Est.ogg"
    Ant "Is there anybody here?"


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_54e52a0e:


    "I heard growling in reply."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_93aa12f4:


    "From around the corner at the end of the corridor, a furry paw appeared and after it, a scary beast face with a pair of burning eyes."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_6d398adf:


    "A huge overweight beast crawled out on its belly, writhing like a snake. It could barely fit inside the corridor's mouth."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_aff6d299:


    "It squeezed forward, clawing at the floorboards."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_b04dce9a:


    "Its maws clanged like a bear trap inches away from my face."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_fe4a7e3c:


    "The beast got stuck."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_9637991f:


    "It banged its paws on the walls, spitting saliva in every direction."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_ad5b4acb:


    "I turned around, I needed to get the hell out of this nightmare!"


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_05bd5442:


    "A hunchback owl, bigger than an average human, landed near the front gate and stood in my way. Its beak kept on clicking."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_dbcede49:


    "A snow pile bulged nearby and something reminiscent of a giant shrew crawled to the outside."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_80f555d4:


    "I fell to my knees as if praying to these eldritch creatures."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_b98a2c92:


    "A figure draped in a dirty fox scalp crawled out of a dark hole, smiling with all its teeth."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_2e6eea9e:


    "Its tail dragged after it, just a piece of vertebrae laced in torn sinews."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_de2b4964:


    "The creatures' bodies became extremely distorted and I decided I was going insane."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_f224fe36:


    "They seemed small to me one moment, as small as a child, only to stretch higher than any of the desolate houses the next."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_4ed39e21:


    "Man-eating creatures towered over me. Something kept on writhing in their stomachs as if looking for a way out."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_050144a9:


    "The longer they stared at me, the wider their twisted smiles, their death masks, became."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_d841615f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/113 Kak.ogg"
    Alis "We had such a long feast!"


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_d3e9efd3:


    "The mutilated fox taxidermy mount licked its lips."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_7ab71cdb:


    "Its tongue looked like a black centipede, longer than my forearm."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_a574b151:


    "The nasty insect ran between the razor-sharp teeth and dropped into the bottomless pit that could swallow the whole world."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_84ba963f:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/Sladkoe.ogg"
    Owl "Hoot-hoot, sweet meat, juicy meat."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_1a4478ad:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/55kak.ogg"
    Bear "We devour it, and we won't stop."


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_f18b01ec:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/56 Vahaha.ogg" 
    Bear "Bwahaha!"


translate english d4_wake_up_devend_9bfefbc8:


